<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">1 Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Kur</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itseǧam x jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />
    <char style="it">Ṯabrat-a</char> zzayi nec Bulus akiḏi umaṯneɣ Sastin. Iȓaɣa-ayi-d Arebbi s ȓxaḍar nnes ḥima aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ arrasul n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Netseǧam xawem kenniw iy iǧan ḏ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi ḏi ṯendint n Kurinṯ. Twassiṣfam ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, twaxḍarem bac aḏ tiȓim ḏ ṣṣaliḥin ak marra yinni itȓaɣan x yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ḏi marra imucan. Netta ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ Siḏiṯsen. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Tcekkareɣ Arebbi xawem ȓebda x arḍa iy ḏawem yuca ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Zi netta, itwarni-yawem ȓxir ḏi kuȓci, iƹni ḏi marra awaȓen ḏ ṯusna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ḏaywem kenniw iy d ismeḍhar Arebbi lḥaqiqa x chaḏeṯ nneɣ x Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />S manaya war ḏawem ṯneqqiṣ uȓa ḏ ijjen n lqudra ruḥiya xmi trajam aḏ d imeḍhar Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Ḏ netta iy kenniw ɣa isbedden ɣar uneggaru ataf war ḏaywem itiȓi bu ȓƹib ḏi Nhar nni n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Arebbi ḏayes ttiqeṯ, zzayes iy ḏaneɣ d yusa uȓaɣi a nƹacar Memmis iƹni Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓmuminin ḏi Kurinṯ ɣarsen lxilaf jarasen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Fa tettareɣ zzaywem ay ayṯma s yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, msefhameṯ ak wayawya ḥima war itiȓi bu lxilaf jarawem. Itxeṣṣa kenniw aḏ tiȓim kif-kif ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem ḏ array nwem. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ay ayṯma, arriɣ-d ȓexbar zi ṯeddarṯ n Kluwi tmenɣam jarawem. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Iƹni, ijjen iqqar nec ḏeffareɣ Bulus. Ijjen iqqar nec ḏeffareɣ Apullus. Ijjen iqqar nec ḏeffareɣ Buṭrus. Ijjen iqqar nec ḏeffareɣ Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Lmasiḥ ma ḏayes lfirqaṯ? Lla! Ma ḏ Bulus itwaṣellben x ṣṣalib ƹlaḥsab kenniw? Lla! Ma ṯetwaṭehharem kenniw s waman s yisem inu Bulus? Lla! <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14-15" />Tcekkareɣ Arebbi war ṭehhireɣ uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaywem s waman illa Krisbus ḏ Ɣayus ḥima war iqqar ḥadd qa itwaṭehhar s waman ƹlaḥsab isem inu. <verse eid="1CO 1:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Wah, nec ṭehhareɣ s waman i ȓeḥbab n Stifanus. War ƹqiȓeɣ ca ma ṭehhareɣ i ḥadd nneɣni s waman ktar zeg yina.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Liʼanna Lmasiḥ war ḏayi d issekk ca ḥima aḏ ṭehhareɣ i yiwḏan s waman; Lla, nec issekk-ayi-d aḏ beccareɣ s Lʼinjil walakin maci s ȓefhameṯ nni n wawaȓen izewwqen. Mayemmi? Bac jjheḏ iy iǧan ḏi ṣṣalib n Lmasiḥ war itbeṭṭiȓ ca.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmasiḥ netta ḏ ȓefhameṯ ḏ jjheḏ n Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Cuf, awaȓ n ṣṣalib netta ḏ ṯubbuhȓiya waha ɣar yinni war inejjmen ca, walakin ɣar neccin inejjmen awaȓ-a netta ḏ jjheḏ n Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Liʼanna iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">&lt;Ȓefhameṯ n yinni itefhamen at heḏmeɣ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">Ȓefṭaneṯ n yinni ifeṭṭnen at sfecȓeɣ.&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Wenni itefhamen zaƹma, ȓexxu mani iǧa? Amseȓmaḏ n ccariƹa zaƹma, ȓexxu mani iǧa? Lfilasuf n ȓweqṯ-a zaƹma, ȓexxu mani iǧa? Yak Arebbi isbuheȓi ȓefhameṯ n yiwḏan n ddunect-a ṯanita? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Isbuheȓi-t s ȓefhameṯ n min netbeccar neccin. Mammec? S ȓefhameṯ-a n Arebbi iƹjeb-as aḏ isenjem yinni itamnen, walakin iwḏan n ddunect-a war zemmaren aṯ ssnen s ȓefhameṯ nsen. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Niṯni israʼiliyen tettaren lmuƹjizaṯ, ḏ yinni war iǧin zi Ayṯ-Israʼil rezzun ȓefhameṯ, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />walakin neccin netbeccar s Lmasiḥ itwaṣellben. Israʼiliyen tneqȓaḍen ḏi manaya, ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil <char style="it">qqaren</char> qa manaya ḏ ṯubbuhȓiya waha. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Walakin i yinni umi d iȓaɣa Arebbi, iƹni israʼiliyen ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, Lmasiḥ netta ḏ jjheḏ n Arebbi ḏ ȓefhameṯ nnes. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Mayemmi? Liʼanna zaƹma ṯubbuhȓiya n Arebbi nettaṯ ṯsefham ktar zi ȓefhameṯ n bnaḏem, zaƹma ḍḍuƹef n Arebbi netta ijheḏ ktar zi jjheḏ n bnaḏem.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Ay ayṯma, fekkareṯ ḏi min tuɣa ṯeǧam qbeȓ wami ḏawem d iȓaɣa i kenniw Arebbi. Maci aṭṭas iḏwem iy ḏi tuɣa ṯeǧa ȓefhameṯ ƹlaḥsab min qqaren yiwḏan. Maci aṭṭas iḏwem kenniw ɣar tuɣa ṯeǧa lmartaba. Maci aṭṭas iḏwem kenniw lʼaṣel nwem tuɣaṯ zeg imeqqranen. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Walakin Arebbi ixḍar min iǧan ḏ ṯubbuhȓiya ɣar yiwḏan n ddunect-a ḥima aḏ ifḍeḥ yinni itefhamen zaƹma. Ixḍar Arebbi min iḍeƹfen ḏi ddunect-a ḥima aḏ ifḍeḥ yinni ijehhḏen. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Ixḍar Arebbi wenni ɣar iǧa lʼaṣel nnes ḏ amezyan ḏ min itwaƹiffan, ixḍar ḥetta ḏ ṯimesȓayin war iǧin ca bac aḏ isbeṭṭeȓ ṯimesȓayin nni iy iǧan. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Mayemmi? Ḥima uȓa ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem war iteftaxar ca zzaṯ i Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />U netta ḏ ssabab iy zi ṯeǧam kenniw ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Iggi-ṯ Arebbi netta ḏ ȓefhameṯ nneɣ, iƹni netta ḏayes ṣṣulḥ nneɣ ḏ uṣeffi nneɣ ḏ ufekki nneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Falihaḏa, mamc iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Wenni irezzun aḏ iftaxar, aḏ iftaxar netta zi Siḏi Arebbi.&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itbeccar s Lmasiḥ itwaṣellben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ay ayṯma, nec wami d usiɣ ɣarwem, usiɣ-d aḏ beccareɣ s ȓmaƹna inuffaren n Arebbi, maci usiɣ-d aḏ beccareɣ s wawaȓen izewwqen niɣ s ȓefhameṯ nni <char style="it">n bnaḏem</char>. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Wami tuɣa ǧiɣ akiḏwem, ggiɣ aḏ scenƹeɣ ɣir Ƹisa Lmasiḥ u ḏ netta itwaṣellben ḏi ṣṣalib. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Tuɣa aqayi akiḏwem s yijjen n ḍḍuƹef ḏ yijjen n ṯiggwḏi, terjijiɣ aṭṭas. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Min qqareɣ ḏ min tḥeddaṯeɣ war iǧi ca s wawaȓen n ȓefhameṯ bac akenniw sqenƹen ḏeɣya; Lla, sxeddameɣ jjheḏ n Arruḥ n Arebbi <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />ḥima lʼiman nwem war itbeddi ca s ȓefhameṯ n bnaḏem, aḏ ibbed s ṯzemmar n Arebbi.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓefhameṯ iy d itasen zi Arruḥ n Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Innama, neccin nessawaḍ ijjen n wawaȓ n ȓefhameṯ ɣar yinni war iqqimen ca ḏ imezyanen ḏi lʼiman nsen. Walakin ȓefhameṯ-a war d tis ca zi ȓweqṯ-a niɣ zi lḥukkam n ȓweqṯ-a ig igguren aḏ fnan. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Lla, neccin nessawaḍ ijjen n ȓefhameṯ ḏayes ȓmaƹna inuffaren n Arebbi ḏ min itwasnuffaren. Izemmem-it Arebbi qbeȓ ma aḏ d ṯexȓeq ȓweqṯ qaƹ ḥima neccin a netwasemɣar. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Ȓefhameṯ-a war t ifhim uȓa ḏ ijjen zi lḥukkam n ȓweqṯ-a. Lla, liʼanna maƹlik tuɣa t fehmen, iȓi war ṣelliben ca Siḏiṯneɣ ɣar ṯeǧa lƹaḍama. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Mamc iqqar Lkitab:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">&lt;Manayenni war ḏinni bu ṯiṭṭ iy ṯ itwaȓan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">niɣ ḏ amejjun iy ḏas itsȓan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">niɣ ḏ ȓaƹqeȓ iy ṯ itxayaȓen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">min isewjeḏ Arebbi i yinni iy ṯ itḥibban.&gt;<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ṯimesȓayin nni ismeḍhar-aneɣ-ṯent-id Arebbi s Arruḥ nnes. Liʼanna Arruḥ n Arebbi ixezzar ḏi ṯmesȓayin marra, waxxa ḏ min yuǧɣen n Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Cuf, min iƹna wenni ig issnen lʼafkar n bnaḏem ɣar ḏaxeȓ? Issen-iṯent arruḥ n bnaḏem nni s yixef nnes. Kif-kif Arebbi, war ḏinni ḥadd issen lʼafkar n Arebbi illa Arruḥ n Arebbi waḥḏes. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />War ḏaneɣ d yuci ca arruḥ n ddunect-a, yuca-aneɣ-d Arruḥ iy d yusin zi Arebbi ḥima a nefhem ṯimesȓayin nni iy ḏaneɣ d yuca Arebbi baṭeȓ. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Nsawaḍ manaya s wawaȓen iy war ṯen ṯseȓmiḏ ca ȓefhameṯ n bnaḏem; Lla, nessawaḍ-iṯ s wawaȓen ig iseȓmaḏ Arruḥ n Arebbi. <char style="it">Awaȓen-a</char> tcarraḥen lḥaqiqaṯ ruḥiyaṯ i yinni umi ɣar iǧa Arruḥ n Arebbi.<verse eid="1CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Bnaḏem ƹadi itagi aḏ iqbeȓ ṯimesȓayin n Arruḥ n Arebbi, ɣares manaya ḏ ṯubbuhȓiya waha. War izemmar ca aṯent ifhem, liʼanna s Arruḥ n Arebbi waḥḏes iy ṯent ɣa imeyyez. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Amma bnaḏem wenni ɣar iǧa Arruḥ n Arebbi. Itmeyyaz marra ṯimesȓayin, netta war ḏayes itmeyyiz ḥadd. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Liʼanna <char style="it">mamc iqqar Lkitab:</char> &lt;Wig issnen ȓaƹqeȓ n Siḏi Arebbi ḥima aṯ isefhem?&gt; U neccin ɣarneɣ ȓaƹqeȓ n Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Lxilaf ḏi Jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Ay ayṯma, nec tuɣa war zemmareɣ ca akiḏwem ssiwȓeɣ am yiwḏan iteggen array i Arruḥ n Arebbi. Lla, ssiwȓeɣ akiḏwem am yiwḏan ig iteggen array i nnefs nsen, am iseyman waha iy d ixeȓqen ḏi Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Uciɣ-awem aḏ tḥeȓwem aɣi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aɣi netta ḏ aceffay ḏi ȓebƹaḍ n imucan ḏi Arrif.</char></note> waha maci lmakla ḏ ṣṣaḥ, lmakla ḏ ṣṣaḥ tuɣa war ḏas ṯzemmarem ca. Aqa ƹaḏ ȓexxu war ḏas ṯzemmarem ca, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />kenniw ƹaḏ teggem array i ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nwem. Meȓa itiȓi ȓeḥseḏ jarawem ḏ umenɣi, ataf teggem array i ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant nwem ataf tƹicem am yiwḏan n ddunect-a waha, niɣ lla? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Cuf, meȓa ijjen iqqar nec ḏeffareɣ Bulus ijjen iqqar nec ḏeffareɣ Apullus, ataf kenniw tƹicem am yiwḏan n ddunect-a, niɣ lla?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Iwa min iƹna Apullus? Min iƹna Bulus? Neccin ḏ ixeddamen waha, ṯumnem x ufus nneɣ mammec ḏaneɣ d yuca Siḏi Arebbi a nexḏem. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Nec ẓẓuɣ, Apullus isessew, u ḏ Arebbi iy kenniw iseɣmayen. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Wenni iteẓẓun ḏ wenni isessawen niṯni war ǧin ḏ walu. Wenni iǧan netta ḏ Arebbi iƹni netta iseɣmayen.<verse eid="1CO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Fa wenni iteẓẓun ḏ wenni isessawen ȓxeḏmeṯ nsen ḏ ijjen, kuȓ ijjen aṯ ijaza ƹlaḥsab ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Liʼanna neccin ncarrec ak Arebbi ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a. Kenniw ḏ amarjeƹ nnes ḏ ȓebni nnes. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Nec ƹlaḥsab arḍa iy ḏayi yuca Arebbi ggiɣ ijjen n dsas am yijjen n lemƹallem ifsus netta. Yusa-d ijjen nneɣni ibenna x dsas-a. Walakin u labud kuȓ ijjen aḏ yarr ȓbaȓ mammec ɣa ibna x dsas-a. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />War ḏinni ḥadd izemmar aḏ igg ijjen n dsas nneɣni x wenni ḏinni itwaggen, u <char style="it">ḏsas-a wanita </char> ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12-13" />Ijjen, meȓa ibna x dsas-a s ddheb niɣ s nnuqarṯ niɣ s ṯizra ṯiṣebḥanin niɣ s ukeccuḍ niɣ s arbiƹ niɣ s urum, ataf ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes aḏ d tban, iƹni Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab iy d ɣa ismeḍhar manaya. U ƹaweḏ manaya aṯid ṯesmeḍhar ijjen n ṯmessi u ṯimessi-ya aḏ tṣaḥḥeḥ man nnuƹ n ȓxeḏmet iy igga mkuȓ ijjen. <verse eid="1CO 3:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Wenni ibnan x dsas-a ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes nican war t tett ca ṯmessi, ataf aṯ ijaza. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Wenni umi ɣar ṯeḥreq ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes, ataf aḏ ixsar ljaʼiza nni. Netta s yixef nnes aḏ injem walakin am wenni yallah d yarewȓen zi ṯmessi.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Ma war ṯessinem ca belli ḏ kenniw iy iǧan ḏ ṯamziḏa n Arebbi, izeddeɣ ḏaywem Arruḥ n Arebbi? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Wenni ɣa iheḏmen ṯamziḏa-ya n Arebbi, aṯ ihḏem Arebbi. Liʼanna ṯamziḏa-ya n Arebbi nettaṯ muqeddes u ḏ kenniw ig iǧan ḏ ṯamziḏa nni.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Itxeṣṣa war ḏinni itiȓi ḥadd ixeddeƹ ixef nnes. Meȓa ḏinni can yijjen jarawem iḥesseb ixef nnes ḏ amiɣis ḏi zman-a, itxeṣṣa aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ abuhaȓi zaƹma bac aḏ yiȓi ḏ amiɣis. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Cuf, ȓefhameṯ n ddunect-a nettaṯ ḏ ṯubbuhȓiya waha ɣar Arebbi. Liʼanna iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Netta iṭṭef imiɣisen ḏeg ixarwiḍen nsen.&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Iqqar ƹaweḏ: &lt;Siḏi Arebbi issen lʼafkar n imiɣisen war neffƹent ca.&gt;<verse eid="1CO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21-22" />Iwa ṣafi, maci aḏ teftaxarem s iryazen. Cuf, kuȓci nwem: waxxa ḏ Bulus niɣ ḏ Apullus niɣ ḏ Buṭrus, niɣ ḏ ddunect-a niɣ ḏ ṯuḏarṯ niɣ ḏ ȓmewṯ, niɣ ḏ min iǧan ȓexxu niɣ ḏ min ɣa yiȓin menbaƹd, iƹni kuȓci nwem. <verse eid="1CO 3:21-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Kenniw n Lmasiḥ, u Lmasiḥ netta n Arebbi.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Ȓxeḏmeṯ n arrusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Cuf, ammu itxeṣṣa aḏaneɣ ẓren yiwḏan iƹni neccin ḏ ixeddamen n Lmasiḥ, neccin netkellaf x ṯmesȓayin inuffaren n Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />U labud yinni itkellafen itxeṣṣa aḏaysen ṯiȓi ttiqeṯ. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Nec war ḏayi ithimmi ca aṭṭas meȓa tḥakamem-ayi kenniw niɣ ḏ can lmaḥkama nneɣni. Uȓa ḏ nec war ǧiɣ bu ḏ ȓqaḍi x yixef inu. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Nec ḍḍamir inu mertaḥ iy iǧa, walakin nec ma bariʼ iy ǧiɣ ƹlaḥsab ḍḍamir inu? Lla, ḏ Siḏi Arebbi iy ḏayi ɣa yucen ȓḥukem-a. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />X manaya war qqarem walu x ȓḥukem qbeȓ ȓweqṯ, iƹni qbeȓ iy d ɣa yas Siḏiṯneɣ. Ḏ netta iy ɣa isbeyynen ṯimesȓayin nni ɣar nnur ȓexxu nuffarent ḏi ṯaǧest, aḏ d ismeḍhar kuȓ lɣaraḍ n yiwḏan iy ɣarsen ḏeg wuȓawen nsen. Ȓexddenni kuȓ ijjen aɣares yiȓi usemɣar nnes zi Arebbi.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Ay ayṯma qqareɣ manaya x Apullus ḏ nec, meṯṯleɣ manaya ḥima azzayes ṯawim nnfaƹ. Kenniw aḏ tȓemḏem zzayneɣ min iƹna lmiṯal nni iqqaren "War tbeƹƹaḏeṯ ca zi min yurin ḏi Lkitab." Amenni war ḏinni ḥadd aḏ isecneƹ can uryaz x unneɣni. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Cek, wi c iscenƹen x unneɣni? Kuȓ ȓḥajeṯ iy ɣarek ṯemmuc-ac niɣ lla? Y cek, wami immuc-ac manayenni mayemmi teftaxareḏ axmi war ḏac immuc ca?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Kenniw, ma ṣaaaafi ɣarwem marra min teḥḏajim? Ma ṣaaaafi kenniw ṯḏewȓem ḏ twajar? Kenniw, ma ḏ ṣṣaḥ ṯḏewȓem ḏ izeǧiḏen bȓa neccin?! Iwa mecḥaȓ xseɣ bac aḏ yiȓi ḏ ṣṣaḥ kenniw teḥkamem ḥima aḏ tcarcem akiḏneɣ ȓeḥkam nni nwem. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Liʼanna tfekkareɣ belli neccin arrusul isfurruj-aneɣ Arebbi ḏ ineggura ḏi lmelƹab, iƹni neccin am yiwḏan ḥekmen xasen s ȓmewṯ aḏ mmṯen ḏinni. Igga-aneɣ a nesfurruj ddunect-a ṯekmaȓ, iƹni iwḏan ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Neccin ḏ ibuhaȓiyen zaƹma ƹlaḥsab Lmasiḥ, y kenniw ma ḏ imiɣisen ḏi Lmasiḥ? Neccin neḍƹef, y kenniw ma ṯjehḏem? Karrmen-kenniw, neccin sbehdaȓen-aneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Qa ƹaḏ ḏi ṯsaƹƹat-a neǧuz, nfuḏ, aqaneɣ s ixarṭiṭen, tmarraṯen-aneɣ, war ɣarneɣ mani ɣa ndurra. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Neccaṯ tamara, nxeddem s ifassen nneɣ. Meȓa niṯni tzebbaȓen ḏayneɣ, neccin netbarrak-iṯen. Meȓa niṯni tƹeddaben-aneɣ, neccin nṣebbar. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Meȓa niṯni qqaren xaneɣ ȓbaṭeȓ, neccin ntarra-d xasen s yijjen n lʼiḥsan. Qa neccin ƹaḏ aȓ ȓexxu neḏweȓ am ṯzewbayṯ n ddunect-a ḏ zzbeȓ n marra yiwḏan.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Maci uriɣ ṯimesȓayin-a bac akenniw feḍḥeɣ; Lla, uriɣ-ṯent bac akenniw nhiɣ am ca n ṯarwa inu iƹizzen. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Waxxa akiḏwem ƹecraȓaf n lmurebbiyin ḏi Lmasiḥ, war ɣarwem ca aṭṭas n babaṯwem. Liʼanna ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ nec ḏ babaṯwem ḏi Lʼinjil. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Iḏen, tcejjaƹeɣ-kenniw aḏayi ṯqelldem mamc teggeɣ nec. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />X manayenni iy xef kenniw d ssekkiɣ Timutawus. Netta iƹizzen xafi am can memmi, ḏayes ttiqeṯ ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ. Akenniw isfekkar x ibriḏen inu ḏi Lmasiḥ mammec ṯen seȓmaḏeɣ ḏi marra imucan ḏ marra ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Fa ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem ḏaysen ttakebbur, tɣir-asen nec war ɣarwem d tiseɣ ca. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Lla, qa ƹȓayen aɣarwem d aseɣ meȓa ixes Arebbi. Yinni iy ḏi iǧan ttakebbur aṯen ssneɣ nec. Maci aṯen ssneɣ min qqaren; Lla, aṯen ssneɣ ma ḏaysen can jjheḏ ma lla. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Liʼanna ȓmulk n Arebbi war iǧi bu ḏeg wawaȓ; Lla, aqaṯ ḏi jjheḏ. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Mamc ṯrezzum aḏ d aseɣ? Ma s uƹmuḏ ma s ȓemḥibbeṯ ak yijjen n wuȓ iṣebbaren?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Ccarr ḏi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Iffeɣ-d ijjen n ȓexbar belli ḏinni ijjen n nnuƹ n lfasad jarawem war xas ṣebbaren ca waxxa ḏ lkuffar! Ijjen n uryaz ɣares ṯamɣarṯ n babas. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Y kenniw, ma ḏaywem ttakebbur?! Lla, kenniw itxeṣṣa aḏ txeyyqem. Itxeṣṣa aḏ tsufɣem wenni iggin manaya zi jmaƹeṯ nwem. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Nec, waxxa ɣabeɣ zzaywem s ddat inu, aqaṯ ḏinni akiḏwem arruḥ inu. Ṣafi, nec axmi aqayi ḏinni ḥekmeɣ x wenni iggin ṯamesȓayṯ-a. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Xmi ɣa ṯmunem s yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa akiḏwem yiȓi arruḥ inu, s jjheḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />aḏ tsufɣem aryaz-a ɣar Cciṭan ḥima aḏ tefna ṭṭabiƹa ṯaƹeffant n nnefs nnes aḏ injem arruḥ nnes ḏi Yum n Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Maci mliḥ wami teftaxarem. War ṯessinem ca illa ɣir ḏrus n untun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Antun netta ḏ amṯun.</char></note> iy d isgaƹƹaḏen marra ȓƹajneṯ n urecṯi?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arecṯi iƹni netta ḏ ariyṯi.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Kkseṯ antun nni aqḏim ḥima aḏ tiȓim ḏ ijjen n ȓƹajneṯ ḏ jḏiḏ n urecṯi bȓa antun. Liʼanna ammu ḏ ṣṣaḥ iy ṯeǧam kenniw. Cuf, itwaɣareṣ ȓƹiḏ nneɣ iƹni Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />X manaya a nƹeyyeḏ walakin war netƹeyyiḏ ca s untun nni aqḏim, iƹni antun nni netta ḏ ȓeqbaḥeṯ ḏ ccarr. Lla, neccin a nƹeyyeḏ s ṯefḍirṯ, iƹni ijjen n uɣrum ḏayes lḥaqiqa war ḏayes bu ixarriqen.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Tuɣa uriɣ-awem-d ḏi ṯebrat nni inu war tƹacareṯ ca yinni iteggen lfasad. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Walakin tuɣa war ssiwiȓeɣ ca x lkuffar n ddunect-a yinni iteggen lfasad niɣ ḏ iḍemmaƹen niɣ ḏ iɣeccacen niɣ ḏ yinni iƹebbḏen lʼaṣnam. Maƹlik amenni, aḏ yiȓi labud aḏ teffɣem zi ddunect-a qaƹ. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Lla, walakin ȓexxu nec uriɣ-awem-d bac war tƹacarem ca ȓmumen wenni iqqaren qa nec ḏ umac walakin netta itegg lfasad niɣ ḏ aḍemmaƹ niɣ iƹebbeḏ lʼaṣnam niɣ iqqar ȓbaṭeȓ niɣ isess aṭṭas n ccreb niɣ ḏ aɣeccac. Ijjen am wanita, war tettem ca akiḏes qaƹ.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Cuf, maci ḏ ccɣeȓ inu aḏ ḥekmeɣ x <char style="it">lkuffar</char> ɣar barra <char style="it">n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</char>; Lla, walakin ḏ ccɣeȓ nwem aḏ tḥekmem x yiwḏan ɣar ḏaxeȓ <char style="it">n jmaƹeṯ</char>. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" /><char style="it">Lkuffar</char> ɣar barra axasen iḥkem Arebbi. <char style="it">Ṣafi, mammec iqqar Lkitab:</char> &lt;Sufɣeṯ xawem bnaḏem aƹeffan.&gt;<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Ccikayaṯ jar ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Can yijjen zzaywem ɣares ccikaya ḍeḏ i yijjen nneɣni. Ma ḏ ṣṣaḥ war itseḏḥi ca netta, itbedda ḏi lmaḥkama ɣar zzaṯ n yinni war yuminen ca maci ɣar zzaṯ n ṣṣaliḥin? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ma war ṯessinem ca belli niṯni ṣṣaliḥin iy ɣa iḥekmen x ddunect-a? Y kenniw meȓa ṯḥekmem x ddunect-a, mayemmi war ṯzemmarem ca aḏ tḥellem ccikayaṯ ṯimezyanin? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ma war ṯessinem ca belli a neḥkem x lmalaʼikaṯ? Iwa u labud a neḥkem x ṯmesȓayin n ṯuḏarṯ-a! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Iḏen, wami jarawem ccikayaṯ am ṯina, mayemmi ṯent ṯsersem zzaṯ i yinni war ɣar ṯeǧi ca lqima ak jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Qqareɣ-awem manaya ḥima aḏ tseḏḥim. Ma ḏ ṣṣaḥ war ḏinni ḥadd jarawem ḏayes ȓefhameṯ ḥima aḏ iḥell ccikayaṯ-a jar ȓmuminin? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Walakin maci mliḥ awmaṯen temcarraƹen ak wayawya zzaṯ i yinni war yuminen ca. <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Xmi kenniw temcarraƹem ak wayawya, ataf ṣafi ṯexsarem. Iwa ḥsen i kenniw meȓa twaḍeȓmem niɣ twaɣeccem. <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Lla, walakin kenniw ṯḍeǧmem teggem ȓɣecc, teggem manaya i ayṯmaṯwem.<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ma war ṯessinem ca belli yinni war yuminen ca war zemmaren aḏ warṯen ȓmulk n Arebbi? War xeddƹem ca ixef nwem. Yinni iteggen lfasad, ḏ yinni iƹebbḏen lʼaṣnam, ḏ yinni izennan, ḏ iḥenjiren ifessḏen ak iryazen, ḏ iryazen ifessḏen ak iryazen, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />ḏ iceffaren, ḏ iḍemmaƹen, ḏ yinni isessen aṭṭas n ccreb, ḏ yinni iqqaren ȓbaṭeȓ, ḏ iɣeccacen war twaraṯen ca ȓmulk n Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Ammu iy tuɣa teggen ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem, walakin ȓexxu twasirḏem, twassiṣfam, twasemṣȓaḥem ak Arebbi s yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ u s Arruḥ n Arebbi nneɣ.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Beƹƹḏeṯ x lfasad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Nec ɣari marra ṯimesȓayin ḥeǧȓent, walakin war neffƹent ca marra ṯimesȓayin nni. Ɣari marra ṯimesȓayin ḥeǧȓent, walakin itxeṣṣa war xafi trayi uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Aḏ yini ijjen: "Iwa lmakla n uƹeddis, aƹeddis n lmakla." Walakin Arebbi aṯen ihḏem s ṯnayen iḏsen. Ddat maci n lfasad, ddat nettaṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ. U Siḏiṯneɣ itḏebbar i ddat. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Arebbi s jjheḏ nnes isekkar-d Siḏiṯneɣ zi ȓmewṯ, aḏaneɣ d isekkar zi ȓmewṯ uȓa ḏ neccin. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ma war ṯessinem ca belli ddat nwem nettaṯ ḏ ṭṭrufaṯ n ddat n Lmasiḥ? Iwa ṭṭrufaṯ-a, ma aṯent ysiɣ aṯent smuneɣ ak lfasdaṯ? Lla, ƹemmarṣ! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ma war ṯessinem wenni itmunen ak lfasda aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ ijjen n ddat akiḏes? Wah, liʼanna iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Niṯni s ṯnayen iḏsen aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ ijjen.&gt; <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Walakin wenni imunen ak Siḏiṯneɣ aḏ iḏweȓ ḏ ijjen n arruḥ akiḏes. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Arewȓeṯ zi lfasad. Kuȓ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nneɣni ig itegg bnaḏem aḏ tiȓi ɣar barra n ddat nnes. Wenni iteggen lfasad iƹeṣṣa ddat nnes nniṯ. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Niɣ ma war ṯessinem ddat nwem nettaṯ ḏ ṯamziḏa n Arruḥ iqeddsen ig izeddɣen ḏaywem? Iwa ɣarwem Arruḥ-a zi Arebbi. Kenniw war trayim ca x yixef nwem <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />minzi twasɣem kenniw s yijjen n ttaman. Falihaḏa, semɣareṯ Arebbi s ddat nwem.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itweṣṣa ȓmuminin x ȓemȓac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Fa ȓexxu a nessiweȓ x ṯmesȓayin iy xef ṯurim kenniw. <char style="it">Maṯalan,</char> mliḥ aryaz meȓa war itḥiḏi ca ṯamɣarṯ. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Walakin ḥsen meȓa kuȓ ijjen aɣares ṯiȓi ṯemɣarṯ nnes, kuȓ icten aɣares yiȓi uryaz nnes ḥima war itiȓi ca lfasad. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />U labud aryaz aḏ yuc ȓḥaqq n ȓemȓac i ṯemɣarṯ nnes. Ammu ƹaweḏ u labud ṯamɣarṯ aḏ tucc ȓḥaqq n ȓemȓac i uryaz nnes. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Ȓaheqqac ṯamɣarṯ war trayi ca x ddat nnes waḥḏes, itraya xas uȓa ḏ aryaz nnes. Ammu ƹaweḏ aryaz war itrayi ca x ddat nnes waḥḏes, traya xas uȓa ḏ ṯamɣarṯ nnes.<verse eid="1CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Itxeṣṣa war ṯqeṭṭƹem ca x wayawya illa meȓa ṯtafqem ak wayawya ijjen n lmudda waha ḥima aḏ tucem ȓweqṯ nni i ṯẓaǧiṯ nwem. Menbaƹd aḏ tmunem ḥima war kenniw itɣarri ca Cciṭan ȓaḥeqqac ataf war ṯzemmarem ca aḏ tḥekmem mliḥ x ccehweṯ nwem. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Walakin manaya maci ḏ ijjen n ȓuṣiyeṯ, qqareɣ-awem-t am yijjen n ttesriḥ. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Rezzuɣ marra iryazen aḏ iȓin am nec. Walakin kuȓ ijjen ɣares ṯizemmar iy ḏas yuca Arebbi, ijjen ɣares ṯin, ijjen ɣares ṯa.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Fa ȓexxu aḏ ssiwȓeɣ x yinni war imȓicen ca ḏ ṯajjaȓin. Iƹni mliḥ meȓa qqimen am nec. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Walakin meȓa war zemmaren ca aḏ ḥekmen x ccehweṯ nsen u labud aḏ meȓcen. Ȓaḥeqqac meȓa meȓcen ḥsen zi meȓa qqimen ḥerrqen ḏi ccehweṯ nsen.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Fa yinni imeȓcen, iweṣṣa xasen Siḏiṯneɣ maci ḏ nec: Memnuƹ ṯamɣarṯ aḏ tesmeḥ ḏeg uryaz. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Meȓa ṯamɣarṯ ṯesmeḥ ḏeg uryaz nnes itxeṣṣa-yas war tmeǧec ca ƹaweḏ, niɣ aḏ tmeṣȓaḥ ak uryaz nnes. Memnuƹ ƹaweḏ aryaz aḏ iǧef i ṯemɣarṯ nnes.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Fa yinni nneɣni, qqareɣ-asen nec (iƹni war t iqqar ca Siḏiṯneɣ, ɣir nec): Meȓa can umaṯneɣ ɣares ṯamɣarṯ maci ḏ ȓmumna ṯeqbeȓ akiḏes ṯƹic, memnuƹ aḏas iǧef. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Ƹaweḏ ṯamɣarṯ, meȓa ɣares aryaz maci ḏ ȓmumen iqbeȓ akiḏes iƹic, memnuƹ aḏas ṯeǧef. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Cuf, aryaz maci ḏ ȓmumen aqaṯ swadday i lƹinaya n Arebbi s ṯemɣarṯ nnes. Ṯamɣarṯ maci ḏ ȓmumna aqat swadday i lƹinaya n Arebbi s uryaz nnes. Meȓa maci amenni, ṯarwa nwem aḏ iȓin s barra n lƹinaya n Arebbi. Walakin ȓexxu aqaṯen swadday i lƹinaya nnes.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Innama, wenni niɣ ṯenni war yuminen ca meȓa ismeḥ, ṣafi aḏ ismeḥ. Iƹni ȓmumen-a ḏ ȓmumna-ya ɣarsen lḥurriya s ḍḍuruf-a liʼanna iȓaɣa-yawem-d Arebbi aḏ tƹicem ḏi ȓehna. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Cuf a ṯamɣarṯ, manis ṯessneḏ cem zaƹma bac aḏ tesnejmeḏ aryaz nnem? Y cek ay aryaz, manis ṯessneḏ cek zaƹma bac aḏ tesnejmeḏ ṯamɣarṯ nnec?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Kuȓ ijjen aḏ iƹic ṯuḏarṯ nnes mamc ḏas t yuca Siḏiṯneɣ, mamc ḏas d iȓaɣa Arebbi. Ammu iy tweṣṣiɣ nec marra ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Can ijjen, meȓa iȓaɣa-yas-d Arebbi u netta tuɣa ggin-as ṭṭahareṯ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṭṭahareṯ nettaṯ ḏ aḥejjem niɣ ḏ axṯan niɣ ḏ lxitam.</char></note> maci aḏ iraḥ aḏ ikkes ṭṭahareṯ nni. Can ijjen, meȓa iȓaɣa-yas-d Arebbi tuɣa war ḏas ggin ca ṭṭahareṯ, maci aḏ irzu aḏ igg ṭṭahareṯ. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Meȓa itṭehhar niɣ war itṭehhir ca, manayenni itwaḥsab ḏ walu. Meȓa itegg s ȓuṣiyaṯ n Arebbi ḏ manayenni ig itwaḥsaben. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Kuȓ ijjen aḏ iqqim ḏi lḥala iy ḏi tuɣa iǧa zi qbeȓ ma ḏas d iȓaɣa Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Cek ma ḏ ismeɣ wami ḏac d iȓaɣa? Iwa bȓa ma ac icqa manaya. Walakin meȓa ɣarek lfurṣa aḏ trebḥeḏ lḥurriya nnec, egg-it. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Liʼanna wenni tuɣa iǧan ḏ ismeɣ wami ḏas d iȓaɣa Siḏiṯneɣ, netta ȓexxu ɣares ijjen n lḥurriya zi Siḏiṯneɣ. Amenni ƹaweḏ wenni tuɣa iǧan ɣares lḥurriya, netta ȓexxu iḏweȓ ḏ ismeɣ n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Ṣafi, isɣi-kenniw s yijjen n ttaman, war tarram ca ixef nwem ḏ isemɣan n bnaḏem. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Ay ayṯma, aḏ iqqim kuȓ ijjen ḏi lḥala nni iy ḏi ḏas d iȓaɣa Arebbi.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Fa ȓexxu aḏ ssiwȓeɣ x ṯḥarmucin war imȓicen ca. War ɣari bu ȓuṣiyeṯ zi Siḏiṯneɣ; Lla qqareɣ manaya s array inu. Teyyqem ḏayi ƹlaḥsab arraḥmeṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Ƹlaḥsab ȓweqṯ-a iqesḥen, iƹni mliḥ meȓa iqqim bnaḏem mamc iǧa. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Cek, ma ɣarek ṯamɣarṯ? War rezzu ca aḏ tsemḥeḏ ḏi manaya. Cek, ma war ɣarek bu ṯemɣarṯ? War rezzu ca x ṯemɣarṯ. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Walakin cek meȓa ṯmeȓceḏ maƹlic, war ṯeƹṣiḏ ca. Ƹaweḏ ṯaḥarmucṯ meȓa ṯemȓec maƹlic, war ṯeƹṣi ca. Walakin yinni imeȓcen aɣarsen iȓin lmacakil ḏi ddunect-a. Nec rezzuɣ axawem sbeƹƹḏeɣ manayenni.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Fa ay ayṯma, min rezzuɣ aḏ iniɣ? Ȓweqṯ aqa ṯqarreb-d. Ssa aȓ ṯsawent yinni imeȓcen aḏ ƹicen axmi war mȓicen ca, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />ḏ yinni itxeyyaqen axmi war txeyyiqen ca, ḏ yinni ifarrḥen axmi war farrḥen ca, ḏ yinni issaɣen axmi manayenni war zzayes tmelliken ca, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />ḏ yinni ineffƹen zi ddunect-a axmi manayenni war zzayes neffƹen ca. Mayemmi? Minzi ṭṭabiƹa n ddunect-a war tdumi ca.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Fa rezzuɣ aḏ tiȓim bȓa amnus. Wenni war imȓicen ca ɣares ijjen n lmuhima i ccɣeȓ n Siḏiṯneɣ, mammec ɣa igg axas yarḍa Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33-34" />Walakin aryaz imeȓcen ɣares ijjen n lmuhima i ccɣeȓ n ddunect-a, mammec ɣa igg axas ṯarḍa ṯemɣarṯ nnes. Netta lmuhimaṯ nnes farrqent x ṯnayen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:33-34">Ṯamɣarṯ war imȓicen ca ḏ ṯenni ig iǧan ḏ ṯaƹzriṯ ɣarsent ijjen n lmuhima i ccɣeȓ n Siḏiṯneɣ, mammec ɣa ggent aḏ ƹebḏent Siḏiṯneɣ s ddat nsent ḏ wuȓ nsent. Ṯamɣarṯ imeȓcen ɣares ijjen n lmuhima i ccɣeȓ n ddunect-a, mammec ɣa ṯegg axas yarḍa uryaz nnes. <verse eid="1CO 7:33-34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Manaya qqareɣ-ṯ bac akenniw nefƹeɣ, maci akenniw sḥesȓeɣ. Lla, rezzuɣ kenniw aḏ tƹicem s lmaƹqul aḏ tƹebbḏem Siḏiṯneɣ maci s can n lmuhima nneɣni.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Fa wenni ixeḍben, meȓa war izemmar ca aḏ iṣbar x ṯḥenjirṯ nni iƹni war iḥekkem ca mliḥ x ccehawaṯ nnes, ṣafi itxeṣṣa-as aḏ igg lwajib nnes iƹni aḏ imȓec akiḏes. Maƹlic netta war iƹeṣṣi ca. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Amma wenni iƹewwȓen mliḥ ḏeg wuȓ nnes aḏ ifsex ak ṯenni ig ixḍeb. Meȓa iƹemmeḏ x manaya ḏeg wuȓ nnes war ḏinni ḥetta ḏ ca n ȓḥajeṯ axas ṯzeyyar iƹni iḥekkem x ccehweṯ nnes, maƹlic igga mliḥ. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />X manaya wenni imeȓcen ak ṯenni ig ixḍeb, maƹlic igga mliḥ. U wenni war kiḏes imȓicen ca, igga ḥsen ƹaḏ.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Ṯamɣarṯ imeȓcen nettaṯ ṯeqqen ɣar uryaz nnes meȓa iddar. Walakin meȓa immuṯ, nettaṯ ɣares ȓḥaqq aḏ temȓec ak wenni ṯxes nettaṯ meȓa <char style="it">netta ḏ ȓmumen</char> zi Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Walakin mammec twaȓiɣ nec, aḏ tfareḥ ktar meȓa ṯeqqim mammec ṯeǧa. Wah, tfekkareɣ belli uȓa ḏ nec akiḏi Arruḥ n Arebbi <char style="it">ḏi manaya</char>.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Aysum itqeddamen i lʼaṣnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Fa lmakla itqeddamen i lʼaṣnam. Neccin marra iḏneɣ ɣarneɣ ṯusna,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> iƹni nessen ṯimesȓayin. Ṯusna-ya iy nessen tsuffa iwḏan s ttakebbur, walakin ȓemḥibbeṯ tarni ḏayneɣ jjheḏ. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Ijjen meȓa itɣir-as issen, lla war issin ca. Ƹaḏ itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ issen. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Walakin wenni itḥibban Arebbi, ataf Arebbi issen-iṯ netta.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Amma lmakla itqeddamen i lʼaṣnam, nessen lʼaṣnam ǧan ḏi ddunect-a walakin ḏ ixarriqen waha. Nessen neccin ijjen n Arebbi ig iǧan, waḥḏes. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Waxxa zaƹma qqaren belli ḏinni arebbiṯen ḏeg ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ, iƹni ɣarsen arebbiṯen nsen mujudin ḏ ssiyaḏiṯsen mujudin. <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />Walakin neccin ɣarneɣ ijjen n Arebbi waḥḏes, netta ḏ Babaṯneɣ. Zzayes netta ǧant marra ṯimesȓayin, neccin neǧa i netta. Ƹaweḏ ɣarneɣ ijjen n Siḏiṯneɣ, iƹni Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Zi netta mizi xeȓqent marra ṯimesȓayin, zzayes mizi nexȓeq neccin.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Walakin maci iwḏan qaƹ ssnen manaya. Ȓebƹaḍ n yiwḏan tuɣa ɣarsen lʼaṣnam ḏ ddin nsen ijheḏ. Meȓa tetten lmakla-ya itqeddamen i lʼaṣnam ataf itɣir-asen manaya ḏ ṣṣaḥ, ḍḍamir nsen iḍeƹfen ataf aḏ ixnez. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Iwa maci ḏ lmakla iy ḏaneɣ ɣa isqarrben ɣar Arebbi; Lla, war ḏaneɣ ineffeƹ ca meȓa necca niɣ war necci ca. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Walakin ḥḍam ixef nwem ḏi lḥurriya-ya nwem ṯanita bac war ṯɣeṭṭȓem ca yinni iḍeƹfen ḏi lʼiman nsen aḏ wḍan.<verse eid="1CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Cuf, wenni umi ɣar iǧa lʼiman iḍƹef. Maƹlik iẓri-c cek ɣarek ṯusna zaƹma tetteḏ ḏeg yijjen n zzawyiṯ n lʼaṣnam, iȓi ṯcejjƹeḏ-ṯ cek ḥima uȓa ḏ netta aḏ icc lmakla itqeddamen i lʼaṣnam, niɣ lla? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />U s ṯusna-ya nnec zaƹma aḏ tdemmareḏ umaṯneɣ wanita iḍeƹfen iy xef immuṯ Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Xmi ṯƹeṣṣim ayṯmaṯwem tḍarram ḍḍamir nsen iḍeƹfen, ataf ḏ Lmasiḥ iy ṯƹeṣṣam. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />X manaya meȓa lmakla inu ṯɣeṭṭeȓ uma ḏi ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, ataf ƹemmarṣ aḏ cceɣ aysum ƹaweḏ ḥima war ɣeṭṭȓeɣ ca uma.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ȓḥaqq n ccarḍ iy ɣarsen ɣar yinni itrayan x ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Ɣari lḥurriya <char style="it">iƹni nec maci ḏ ismeɣ</char>. Nec ḏ arrasul, ẓriɣ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. Yac ḏ kenniw iy iǧan ḏ nnatija n ȓxeḏmeṯ inu ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ, niɣ lla? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Meȓa war ǧiɣ ḏ arrasul i can yiwḏan nneɣni, ataf i kenniw iy ɣa ǧiɣ ḏ arrasul. Liʼanna kenniw ḏ ddalil igga-ayi nec Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ arrasul.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Ḏ wa ḏ ddifaƹ inu ɣar yinni ḏayi iteggen lʼistijwab. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Iƹni, neccin ma war ɣarneɣ bu ȓḥaqq a necc a nsew? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Neccin ma war ɣarneɣ bu ȓḥaqq a nawi akiḏneɣ ṯimɣarin ȓmuminaṯ mammec ggin arrusul nneɣni ḏ ayṯmas n Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ Buṭrus? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Ma nec ḏ Barnaba waheḏneɣ iy war ɣar iǧi ȓḥaqq ḏi ccarḍ, ma itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ i neccin a nexḏem ḏi can ȓḥajeṯ nneɣni bac a nƹic?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Cuf, ma iǧa ca ḥadd aḏ yaḏef ḏi ȓƹaskar aḏ ixḏem bȓa ma aḏ itxaȓes? Lla! Ma iǧa ca ḥadd aḏ iẓẓu ṯzayarṯ uḍiȓ bȓa ma aḏ icc ṯizewrin nnes? Lla! Ma iǧa ca ḥadd aḏ yarwes ṯḥimerṯ bȓa ma aḏ isew aɣi nnes? Lla! <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Ma qqareɣ manaya ƹlaḥsab array n bnaḏem waha? Lla, ƹlaḥsab array n ccariƹa iqqar kif-kif. <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Iƹni iqqar Lkitab n Musa: War ḏas tegg bu ṯacmant i ufunas nni itṣarwaṯen. Ma i iyenduzen waha umi iticc Arebbi lhimma? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Niɣ iqqar-it marra ƹlaḥsab neccin? Wah, iqqar-it ƹlaḥsab neccin. Liʼanna wenni icerrzen ḏ wenni iṣarwaṯen u labud aḏ rezzun aḏ ccen zi ṯfeǧaḥṯ nni. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Meȓa tuɣa nezreƹ jarawem ṯimesȓayin n ujenna, ma ḏ aṭṭas xaneɣ meȓa nemjar zzaywem ṯimesȓayin n ṯmurṯ? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Meȓa iwḏan nneɣni ɣarsen ȓḥaqq nni n ccarḍ aḏasen ṯucem, yak neccin ɣarneɣ ȓḥaqq-a ktar niɣ lla?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Walakin neccin nugi a nkessi ȓḥaqq-a wanita. Nṣebbar aṭṭas i ṯmesȓayin bac war netbellaƹ ca ṯawwarṯ i Lʼinjil. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ma war ṯessinem ca yinni ixeddmen ḏi ṯemziḏa kessin-d lmakla nsen zzayes, ḏ yinni ixeddmen ḏi ȓmeḏbaḥ kessin-d ȓḥaqq nsen zi min itwaɣarrṣen ḏi ȓmeḏbaḥ? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Amenni uȓa ḏ yinni itbeccaren s Lʼinjil, yumar xasen Siḏiṯneɣ aḏ kessin ccarḍ nsen zi Lʼinjil.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Walakin nec war ksiɣ ca uȓa ḏ ijjen zi ȓḥuquq nni. Ƹaweḏ nec war tariɣ ca ṯabrat-a ȓexxu ḥima ataf kenniw aḏayi ṯucem ȓḥuquq nni; Lla, nec ḥsen meȓa mmuṯeɣ qbeȓ ma aḏayi ikkes ḥadd manaya minzi ɣa ftaxreɣ. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Walakin meȓa tbeccareɣ, war zemmareɣ aḏ ftaxreɣ liʼanna itxeṣṣa-ayi u labud aḏ beccareɣ. Ya tamara xafi nec maƹlik war tbeccareɣ ca! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Meȓa tbeccareɣ s ȓxaḍar inu, ataf aḏayi ijaza <char style="it">Arebbi</char>. Meȓa war iǧi bu s ȓxaḍar inu, iƹni ataf teggeɣ ijjen n lmesʼuliya bezzez xafi waha. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Iḏen, min iƹna ccarḍ inu? Ccarḍ inu ḏ wa: Xmi tbeccareɣ s Lʼinjil tqeddameɣ-ṯ baṭeȓ iƹni maci ƹlaḥsab ȓḥaqq n ccarḍ-a iy ɣari ḏi Lʼinjil.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Waxxa nec war ɣari bu bab inu, walakin arriɣ ixef inu ḏ ismeɣ zaƹma i marra bac aḏ rebḥeɣ aṭṭas n zziyada n yiwḏan. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Nec arriɣ ixef inu am yijjen ḏ aʼisraʼili ɣar Ayṯ-Israʼil bac ataf aṯen rebḥeɣ. Arriɣ ixef inu am yijjen minxef ṯḥekkem Ccariƹa n Musa ɣar yinni minxef ṯḥekkem Ccariƹa n Musa bac ataf aṯen rebḥeɣ (waxxa nec war xafi ṯḥekkem ca ccariƹa nni). <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Arriɣ ixef inu am yijjen war ɣares ṯeǧi ca Ccariƹa n Musa ɣar yinni war ɣarsen ṯeǧi ca Ccariƹa n Musa bac ataf aṯen rebḥeɣ (waxxa nec war ǧiɣ ca bȓa ccariƹa n Arebbi, ṯḥekkem xafi ccariƹa n Lmasiḥ). <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Arriɣ ixef inu am yijjen iḍƹef ɣar yinni iḍeƹfen bac ataf aṯen rebḥeɣ. Arriɣ ixef inu ḏ marra i marra iwḏan bac aḏ ggeɣ marra lʼimkaniyaṯ aḏ snejmeɣ ca zzaysen. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Nec teggeɣ marra manaya ƹlaḥsab Lʼinjil ḥima aḏ carceɣ ḏi lbarakaṯ nnes.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ma war ṯessinem ca ṯazȓa nni iteggen ḏi lmelƹab? Marra tazzȓen walakin ijjen waha iy ɣa irebḥen ljaʼiza. Ammeni uȓa ḏ kenniw itxeṣṣa aḏ tazȓem bac at ṯrebḥem. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Marra yinni itemƹanaḏen ḏi lmelƹab ḥekkmen x ddat nsen ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin-a. Teggen manaya bac aḏ d awin ijjen n ttaj war ḏasen itdumi ca. Walakin neccin ntegg manaya bac a d nawi ijjen n ttaj itduman i ȓebda. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />X manaya war tizzȓeɣ ca bȓa lʼitijah, war cciṯeɣ ca s ȓbuks am wenni iccaṯen ḏi lhawa waha. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Lla, tzeyyareɣ x ddat inu tarriɣ-t ḏ ṯismeɣṯ inu. Maci aḏ beccareɣ awaȓ i yiwḏan u <char style="it">ɣar uneggaru</char> aḏ iȓiɣ ak yinni iy ṯen isufuɣen bȓa ljaʼiza.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Ṯaɣennant n Ayṯ-Israʼil nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n lƹibra i neccin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Cuf ay ayṯma, war xseɣ ca aḏ tettum belli ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ tuɣaṯen qaƹin swadday i useynu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayṯ-Israʼil wami arewȓen zi Miṣra, Siḏi Arebbi iggur ɣar zzaṯ nsen amecnaw ij useynu. Aseynu nni tuɣaṯ am yijjen n upilar iseḍhar-asen-d abriḏ s uziȓ. S ǧireṯ tuɣaṯ amecnaw ijjen n ṯmessi, ṯimessi nni tegg-asen ṯfawṯ ḥima aḏ uyuren s ǧireṯ ḏ uziȓ. Aseynu nni ḏ ṯmessi nni s ṯnayen iḏsen tuɣaṯen qqimen ḏinni ȓebda ɣar zzaṯ i Ayṯ-Israʼil.</char></note> nni iḥeṭṭa-ṯen. Marra niṯni ẓwan ɣar ujemmaḍ-in n Ȓebḥar Azeggwaɣ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wami arewȓen Ayṯ-Israʼil zi Miṣra, uwḍen ɣar Ȓebḥar Azeggwaɣ abriḏ nsen ibelleƹ ƹȓayen axasen d ḥeȓṯen ȓƹaskar n Miṣra. Ȓexddenni ikkar Siḏna Musa isarreḥ fus nnes ɣar ujenna n ȓebḥar nni issekk-d Siḏi Arebbi asemmiḍ ḏ ccarqi ijheḏ yarra ȓebḥar aȓ ṯcarmin, s ǧiȓeṯ nni yarri-ṯ ḏ ṯamurṯ ṯuzeɣ. Iqqim ȓebḥar nni inefreq x ṯnayen, ẓwan Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi ȓwesṭ x ṯmurṯ nni yuzɣen. Aman ḏewȓen amecnaw ṯnayen n ȓeḥyuḍ ijjen x uẓeȓmaḍ ijjen x ufusi.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Marra niṯni twaṭehharen s waman ƹlaḥsab Musa wami ƹḏun ḏeg useynu nni ḏ ȓebḥar nni. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Marra niṯni ccin zeg yijjen n lmakla ruḥiya. <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />Marra niṯni swin zeg yijjen n ṯsessi ruḥiya. Liʼanna niṯni swin zeg uɣbaȓ nni n uzru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayṯ-Israʼil wami ṣafi arewȓen zi Miṣra qqimen ugguren ḏi ȓexȓa, war ufin min ɣa swen qqimen yiwḏan tceṯcan x Siḏi Arebbi ḏ Siḏna Musa. Iysi Siḏna Musa ṯaɣȓiṯ nnes zzaṯ i Siḏi Arebbi mammec ṯ yumar. Ikkar Siḏna Musa ḏ umas Harun ijmeƹ-d ccaƹb zzaṯ i yijjen n uzru ḏ ameqqran inna-asen Siḏna Musa: "Ṣennṭem a yinni war iteggen ca array i Arebbi, ma itxeṣṣa-yaneɣ aḏawem d nsufeɣ aman zeg uzru-ya?" Ȓexddenni isiȓi Siḏna Musa fus nnes yuwṯa azru nni marrṯayen iḏweȓ ḏ aɣbaȓ. Duqzen zzayes waman aṭṭas, swin ccaƹb ḏ ȓeksibeṯ nsen zeg uɣbaȓ n waman nni.</char></note> ruḥiya iy ṯen iḏeffaren, aɣbaȓ nni n uzru tuɣaṯ netta ḏ Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Waxxa amenni ȓebƹaḏ zzaysen waha mixef yarḍa Arebbi, inneɣni menḍaren ḏinni ḏ immurḍas ḏi ȓexȓa nni.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Ṯimesȓayin-a weqƹent ḏ ijjen n lƹibra i neccin. Mayemmi? Bac war ḏayneɣ itiȓi mezȓi x ccarr mammec tuɣa cehhan niṯni. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />War ƹebbḏeṯ ca lʼaṣnam mammec ggin ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen. Mammec iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Iwḏan nni qqimen aḏ swen aḏ ccen, uca kkaren aḏ zhun.&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Itxeṣṣa war nfesseḏ ca mammec ggin ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen, mmuṯen wḍan ɣar ṯmurṯ can ṯȓaṯa u ƹicrin aȓaf zzaysen ḏeg yijjen n nhar. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Itxeṣṣa war nzeƹƹem ca a nẓer min ɣa igg Lmasiḥ, mammec ggin ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen uca twanɣen s ifiɣeran. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Itxeṣṣa war netceṯca ca mammec ggin ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen wami xasen iqḍa Ƹazȓayen.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Weqƹent-asen ṯimesȓayin-a ḏ ijjen n lƹibra i neccin. Zemmmen-ṯent ḥima azzaysent neȓmeḏ neccin, iƹni xeḍȓent-id xaneɣ aȓ uneggaru-ya n zmanaṯ. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />S manaya wenni umi itɣiȓ-as qa ibedd war iweṭṭi ca, itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ d yarr ȓbaȓ nnes. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Ṯimesȓayin nni ṯinni ig itiȓin ȓebda ak bnaḏem ḏ ṯinni iy kenniw itɣarran. U Arebbi netta ḏayes ttiqeṯ, war kenniw itejji ca aḏ twaɣarram s min war ṯzemmarem aḏ teṣbarem; Lla, aḏawem iḏebbar ijjen n ṯewwarṯ ḥima aḏ teṣbarem i manayenni.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />S manayenni ay imƹizzen inu, arewȓeṯ zi lʼaṣnam. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Ssawaȓeɣ akiḏwem ɣarwem ȓaƹqeȓ nwem, meyyzeṯ min qqareɣ ma ḏ ṣṣaḥ ma lla. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Ȓkas nni n lbaraka iy zi netbarak neccin, zzayes iy ncarrec ḏeg iḏammen n Lmasiḥ. Aɣrum nni iy netrezza, zzayes iy ncarrec ḏi ddat n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Ḏinni ijjen n ṯxebbast n uɣrum waḥḏes, s ssabab-a neccin ḏ ijjen, waxxa ḏinni aṭṭas iy iḏneɣ. Minzi neccin marra iḏneɣ ncarrec ḏeg yijjen n ṯxebbast. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Fekkareṯ ḏi Ayṯ-Israʼil, yak yinni itetten dbiḥaṯ niṯni carrcen ḏi ȓmeḏbaḥ nni, niɣ lla? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Min xseɣ nec aḏ iniɣ? Ma qqareɣ belli lmakla nni itqeddamen i lʼaṣnam nettaṯ ḏ ca n ȓḥajeṯ? Niɣ qqareɣ belli lʼaṣnam niṯni ḏ ca n ȓḥajeṯ? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Lla, walakin qqareɣ belli min ɣarrṣen lkuffar ḏ dbiḥaṯ tqeddamen-ṯent i ccayaṭin maci i Arebbi. Nec war xseɣ ca akiḏsen ṯcarcem ak ccayaṭin. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />War ṯzemmarem ca aḏ teswem zi ȓkas n Siḏiṯneɣ niɣ zi ȓkas n ccayaṭin s ṯnayen iḏsen. War ṯzemmarem ca aḏ tcarcem ḏi missa n Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ missa n ccayaṭin s ṯnayen iḏsent. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Ma nrezzu a nesƹeṣṣeb Siḏiṯneɣ s lɣira? Niɣ ma nejheḏ xas neccin?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lḥurriya n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Marra ṯimesȓayin ḥeǧȓent, walakin maci marra ṯimesȓayin testenfaƹent. Marra ṯimesȓayin ḥeǧȓent, walakin maci marra ṯimesȓayin aḏaneɣ sjehḏent. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />War rezzuṯ ca ȓxir i yixef nwem, rzum-ṯ i wajjar nwem. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Cceṯ min ma ṯufim itmenza ḏi ssuq n igezzaren, war tseqsam ca jjeṯ ḍḍamir nwem mertaḥ. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Liʼanna <char style="it">iqqar</char>: &lt;Ṯamurṯ-a nettaṯ ḏ marra min ḏayes n Siḏi Arebbi.&gt;<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Meȓa can yijjen maci ḏ ȓmumen iƹareḍ-ikenniw bac aḏ teccem akiḏes u kenniw ṯrezzum aḏ traḥem, cceṯ min ma ṯufim sersen-t zzaṯ nwem war tseqsam ca, jjeṯ ḍḍamir nwem mertaḥ. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Walakin meȓa inna-awem ḥadd qa manaya qeddmen-ṯ ḏ dbiḥeṯ i lʼaṣnam, war t tettem ca. Manaya ƹlaḥsab wenni iy ḏawem ṯ iqqaren u ƹlaḥsab ḍḍamir. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Iƹni ḍḍamir n wenni iy kenniw iƹarḍen, maci ḏ ḍḍamir nwem. Ȓaḥeqqac nec mayemmi ḍḍamir n yijjen nneɣni aḏ iḥkem x lḥurriya inu? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Meȓa cekkareɣ Arebbi x can lmakla, mayemmi iy ḏayi ɣa ḥasben x manayenni iy zi cekkareɣ Arebbi?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Iḏen, meȓa ṯsessem niɣ tettem niɣ min ma teggem, ggeṯ marra manayenni bac aḏ itwasemɣar Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />War ɣeṭṭȓeṯ ḥadd waxxa niṯni ḏ israʼiliyen niɣ ḏ iyunaniyen niɣ ḏ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Nec rezzuɣ aḏ sarḍiɣ marra iwḏan ḏi marra min teggeɣ. War rezzuɣ ca ȓxir i yixef inu, rezzuɣ-ṯ i marra iwḏan bac aḏ nejmen.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Ȓmuminaṯ ḏi lƹibada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Ḏeffarem-ayi-d mammec ḏeffareɣ nec Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Fa tcekkareɣ-kenniw wami teƹqaȓem xafi ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin, ṯḥeffḍem ttaƹlim nni mammec ḏawem ṯ seȓmaḏeɣ nec.<verse eid="1CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Walakin xseɣ akenniw sfehmeɣ mliḥ qa azeǧif n mkuȓ aryaz netta ḏ Lmasiḥ <char style="it">u ḏ netta ig itrayan</char>. Azeǧif n mkuȓ ṯamɣarṯ netta ḏ aryaz <char style="it">u ḏ netta ig itrayan</char>. Azeǧif n Lmasiḥ netta ḏ Arebbi <char style="it">u ḏ netta ig itrayan</char>. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Mkuȓ aryaz ig itẓaǧan niɣ issawaȓ s min iƹȓem zi Arebbi azeǧif nnes iɣemmes, ataf netta war itweqqar ca azeǧif nnes. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Mkuȓ ṯamɣarṯ ig itẓaǧan niɣ ṯessawaȓ s min ṯeƹȓem zi Arebbi azeǧif nnes war iɣemmes ca, ataf nettaṯ war tweqqar ca azeǧif nnes. Itwaḥsab axmi azeǧif nnes itwaḥeff ḏ aqeccar. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ṯamɣarṯ meȓa ṯugi aḏ teɣmes i uzeǧif nnes ḥsen meȓa ṯḥeff acewwaf nnes. Walakin ḏ ijjen n ȓefḍiḥeṯ ṯamɣarṯ meȓa ṯḥeff niɣ ṯeḏweȓ ḏ ṯaqeccarṯ, iƹni itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ teɣmes i uzeǧif nnes. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Cuf, aryaz itxeṣṣa-yas war iɣemmes ca i uzeǧif nnes liʼanna netta ḏ ṣṣifeṯ ḏ ccenƹeṯ n Arebbi, ṯamɣarṯ nettaṯ ḏ ccenƹeṯ n uryaz. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Aryaz war d itwaxȓiq ca zi ṯemɣarṯ. Lla, ṯamɣarṯ iy d itwaxeȓqen zeg uryaz.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issawaȓ ḏanita x Siḏna Adam ḏ Ḥawwa. Isuḍeṣ Siḏi Arebbi Adam, ikkes-as ijjen n yiɣes zeg uɣezḏis. Iɣes nni yarri-ṯ Siḏi Arebbi ḏ ṯamɣarṯ qqaren-as Ḥawwa. Zi ssenni yuwi-t Arebbi ɣar Siḏna Adam.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Ƹaweḏ aryaz war d itwaxȓiq ca i ṯemɣarṯ. Lla, ṯamɣarṯ iy d itwaxeȓqen i uryaz.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xzar Imezwura 2:18: "Ikkar Arebbi ifekkar inna: War ṯƹeddeȓ aḏ jjeɣ Adam waḥḏes, itxeṣṣa aḏas ggeɣ wi ṯ ɣa iƹawnen aṯ iƹacar."</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />S manayenni u ƹlaḥsab lmalaʼikaṯ itxeṣṣa-yas i ṯemɣarṯ aɣares ṯiȓi ijjen n lƹalama n ssulṭa x uzeǧif nnes.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Innama, ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ ṯamɣarṯ taƹtamad x uryaz, aryaz itaƹtamad x ṯemɣarṯ. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Liʼanna mammec ṯexȓeq ṯemɣarṯ zeg uryaz, amenni ȓexxu aryaz ixeǧeq-d zi ṯemɣarṯ. U marra zi Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Ḥekmeṯ s yixef nwem. Ma maƹqul ṯamɣarṯ aḏ teẓẓaǧ i Arebbi bȓa ma aḏ teɣmes i uzeǧif nnes? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Yak ddunect-a s yixef nnes ṯseȓmaḏ-ikenniw, aryaz meȓa ijja acewwaf ḏ azeyrar ḏ ȓƹib niɣ lla? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Walakin ṯamɣarṯ meȓa ṯejja acewwaf ḏ azeyrar netta ḏ ijjen n ccan nnes. Liʼanna acewwaf nnes azeyrar immuc-as bac azzayes ṯeɣmes i uzeǧif nnes. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Meȓa ḏinni can yijjen irzu aḏ imɣannen x manaya, neccin war nennum ca can lƹada nneɣni, uȓa ḏ ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi war nnument ca can ȓḥajeṯ nneɣni.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amensi n Siḏiṯneɣ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Nec tweṣṣiɣ-kenniw, ȓexxu war kenniw tcekkareɣ ca. Ȓaḥeqqac ṯijumaƹ nwem tḍarrant ktar zi min kenniw neffƹent. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Ḏ amezwaru, xmi tmunem jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin tesȓiɣ belli tiȓin jarawem lxilafaṯ, u nec tamneɣ manaya illa ḏayes cwayt n ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ȓaḥeqqac wa labud aḏ iȓin lxilafaṯ jarawem bac aḏ d banen yinni iǧan nican jarawem. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Xmi tmunem kenniw, ma tettem amensi n Siḏiṯneɣ <char style="it">nican</char>? Lla, walu. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Mayemmi? Liʼanna kuȓ ijjen min itegg: ijjen itraḥ itett waha bȓa ma aḏ iraja wenni nneɣni, ijjen iǧuz, ijjen isess aṭṭas n waman uḍiȓ. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Cuf, ma war ɣarwem bu ṯuḏrin mani iy ɣa ṯeccem niɣ ḏ mani iy ɣa ṯeswem? Kenniw, ma tseḥqarem jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi tḥeggarem yinni war ɣar iǧi walu? Min ḏawem ɣa iniɣ? Ma kenniw iy ɣa cekkareɣ x manaya? Lla, walu.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />
    <char style="bd">Cuf, nec aqa min ḏayi yuca Siḏiṯneɣ u ḏ manaya iy ḏawem d ssiwḍeɣ iƹni ḏi ǧiȓeṯ nni iy ḏi immenz Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa iysi-d netta aɣrum,</char> <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" /><char style="bd">wami icekkar Arebbi irez-iṯ inna: "Ḏ wa ig iǧan ḏ ddat inu iy ɣa immucen ƹlaḥsab kenniw. Teggeṯ manaya ḥima aḏayi tfekkarem." </char> <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" /><char style="bd">Ammu ƹaweḏ wami kemmȓen amensi, iysi-d netta ȓkas nni, inna: "Ȓkas-a ḏ ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ iy kiḏwem teggeɣ s iḏammen</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note> <char style="bd">inu. Teggeṯ manaya meȓmi ma ṯ ṯeswim ḥima aḏayi tfekkarem." </char> <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" /><char style="bd">Minzi meȓmi ma ṯeccim zeg uɣrum-a ṯeswim zi ȓkas-a, aqa txebbarem s ȓmewṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ aȓ d ɣa yas. </char><verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Aqa wenni iy ɣa iccen zeg uɣrum-a n Siḏiṯneɣ niɣ ḏ wenni iy ɣa iswen zi ȓkas-a war ḏasen iticc ca lqima, ataf netta itegg ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant ak ddat ḏ iḏammen n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Iwa itxeṣṣa-yas i bnaḏem aḏ irajeƹ ixef nnes qbeȓ ma aḏ icc zeg uɣrum-a, qbeȓ ma aḏ isew zi ȓkas-a. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Aqa wenni itetten isessen bȓa ma aḏ iƹqeȓ nican x ddat <char style="it">n Siḏiṯneɣ</char>, ataf itett isess lƹiqab i yixef nnes. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />S manayenni ḏinni aṭṭas jarawem ig iǧan ḍeƹfen heȓcen, can ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem mmuṯen. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Maƹlik nḥekkem x yixef nneɣ nican, ataf neccin war netwaḥkam ca. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Xmi xaneɣ itaḥkam Siḏiṯneɣ iƹni inehha-yaneɣ bac war nkessi ca lƹiqab n ddunect-a.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />X manaya ay ayṯma, xmi tmunem aḏ teccem rajaṯ ayawya. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Can yijjen meȓa iǧuz, itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ icc ḏi ṯeddarṯ nnes bac xmi ɣa ṯmunem ataf war kenniw itḥissib ca Arebbi. Xmi d ɣa aseɣ nec ataf akenniw weṣṣiɣ x ṯmesȓayin nni nneɣni.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Arruḥ iqeddsen iticcen lqudraṯ i ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Fa amma lqudraṯ ruḥiyaṯ. Ay ayṯma, war xseɣ ca axasent tqefaȓem ixef nwem. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Qa ṯessnem belli wami tuɣa kenniw ḏ lkuffar twasufɣem zeg ubriḏ ɣar lʼaṣnam izeynunen. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />S manayenni xseɣ aḏ tfehhmem mliḥ belli war ḏinni ḥadd aḏ yini s Arruḥ n Arebbi &lt;qa Ƹisa itwanƹeȓ&gt;! Ƹaweḏ war ḏinni ḥadd aḏ yini &lt;qa Ƹisa ḏ Mawlana&gt; illa s Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Fa ḏinni lʼanwaƹ n lqudraṯ, walakin Arruḥ ḏ ijjen. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Ḏinni lʼanwaƹ n lmesʼuliyaṯ, walakin Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ ijjen. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Ḏinni lʼanwaƹ n ȓexḏayem, walakin Arebbi ḏ ijjen ḏ netta iy ṯent isxeddamen marra ḏi kuȓ bnaḏem. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Immuc-as i kuȓ ijjen iy zi ɣa ismeḍhar ȓxeḏmeṯ n Arruḥ iqeddsen bac aḏ infeƹ marra iwḏan. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ijjen immuc-as s ufus n Arruḥ iqeddsen bac aḏ issiweȓ s lḥikma. Ijjen immuc-as awaȓ n ṯusna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> s ufus n Arruḥ-a wanita. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Ijjen immuc-as lʼiman ijheḏ s ufus n Arruḥ-a wanita. Ijjen mmucent-as can lqudraṯ bac aḏ isgenfa s ufus n Arruḥ-a wanita. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Ijjen immuc-as aḏ igg lmuƹjizaṯ. Ijjen immuc-as aḏ issiweȓ s min iƹȓem zi Arebbi. Ijjen mmucent-as ṯizemmar aḏ imeyyez jar n arruḥaṯ. Ijjen immuc-as aḏ issiweȓ s ȓebƹaḍ n lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ. Ijjen immuc-as aḏ istarjem lluɣaṯ nni. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Marra ṯimesȓayin-a ṯina twasxeddament s ufus n yijjen n Arruḥ wanita. Ifareq-iṯent i kuȓ ijjen waḥḏes mammec ixes netta.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Marra neccin ḏ ijjen n ddat ḏi Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Cuf, ddat nneɣ nettaṯ ḏ icten ɣares aṭṭas n ṭrufaṯ, waxxa ṭrufaṯ-a aṭṭas iy iǧan niṯni ḏ ijjen. Ammu iǧa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Liʼanna neccin marra netwaṭehhar s waman s yijjen n Arruḥ bac a niȓi ḏ ijjen n jmaƹeṯ, iƹni Ayṯ-Israʼil niɣ ḏ iyunaniyen, ḏ yinni ɣar iǧa bab nsen niɣ ḏ yinni ɣar ṯeǧa lḥurriya nsen. Neccin marra iḏneɣ yuca-aneɣ a nsew <char style="it">iƹni a ncarec</char> ḏeg yijjen n Arruḥ.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Ȓexxu cuf, ddat war ɣares ca ijjen n ṭṭarf waha; Lla, ɣares aṭṭas n ṭrufaṯ. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Meȓa inna uḍar nnes qa nec war ǧiɣ ca ḏ fus nec war ǧiɣ ca zi ddat-a, maci s wawaȓ-a iy ɣa iffeɣ zi ddat-a. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Meȓa inna umejjun nnes qa nec war ǧiɣ ca ḏ ṯiṭṭ nec war ǧiɣ ca zi ddat-a, maci s wawaȓ-a iy ɣa iffeɣ zi ddat-a. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Meȓa ddat ṯekmaȓ nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n ṯiṭṭ, manis iy ɣa ṯṣenneṭ? Meȓa ddat ṯekmaȓ nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n umejjun, manis iy ɣa ṯcumm? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Walakin ȓexxu Arebbi isettef ṭrufaṯ n ddat issen kuȓ icten mammec ixes at igg. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Iwa maƹlik ṭrufaṯ-a marra tuɣa ḏ ijjen, mani ṯeǧa ddat? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ȓexxu ḏinni aṭṭas n ṭrufaṯ walakin ḏinni ijjen n ddat waha.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Fa ṯiṭṭ war ṯzemmar aḏas ṯini i ufus qa ṣafi nec war c teḥḏijiɣ ca. Niɣ ƹaweḏ azeǧif aḏasen yini i iḍaren qa ṣafi nec war kenniw teḥḏijiɣ ca. <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Lla, ṭrufaṯ nni n ddat iy ḏaneɣ tɣiȓ ḍeƹfent ataf niṯenti twaḥḏajant ktar. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Ṭrufaṯ nni n ddat iy ḏaneɣ tɣiȓ war ɣarsent bu lqima, ataf aḏasent negg lqima ktar. Ƹaweḏ ṭrufaṯ nneɣ iy war d tbinent ca, ataf netseḏḥa zzaysent ktar. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Walakin ṭrufaṯ nneɣ iy d tbanent war teḥḏijint ca azzaysent nseḏḥa. Iƹni Arebbi igga lƹaks, isettef ṭrufaṯ n ddat bac aḏ yuc lqima i ṭṭarf nni iteḥḏajan lqima. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Ammu war iǧi bu lxilaf ḏi ddat, thellant ḏeg waywaya kif-kif. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Meȓa can yijjen itwaƹeddab, aḏ twaƹeddaben kuȓci. Meȓa can yijjen ṯemmuc-as lqima, akiḏes farḥen marra.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Fa kenniw ḏ ddat-a <char style="it">iƹni ḏ jmaƹeṯ</char> n Lmasiḥ, kuȓ ijjen zzaywem ḏ ijjen ṭṭarf zzayes. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Ḏi jmaƹeṯ-a n ȓmuminin iretteb Arebbi ḏ amezwaru arrusul, wis ṯnayen lʼanbiya, wis ṯȓaṯa imseȓmaḏen, menbaƹd yinni isxeddamen lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ yinni ɣar ǧant lqudraṯ bac aḏ sgenfan iwḏan, ḏ yinni itƹawanen, ḏ yinni itkellafen s ȓxeḏmeṯ, ḏ yinni issawaȓen s ȓebƹaḍ n lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Ma zaƹma marra iḏsen ḏ arrusul? Ma marra iḏsen ḏ lʼanbiya? Ma marra iḏsen ḏ imseȓmaḏen? Ma marra iḏsen sxeddamen lmuƹjizaṯ? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Ma marra iḏsen ɣarsen lqudraṯ aḏ sgenfan? Ma marra iḏsen ssawaȓen s lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ? Ma marra iḏsen starjamen?<verse eid="1CO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Fa kenniw ṯrezzum aṭṭas x lqudraṯ yuƹȓan, nec aḏawem cerrḥeɣ ijjen n ubriḏ yuƹȓan x marra ibriḏen.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Izȓi x ubriḏ iy yuƹȓan qaƹ x marra</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Maƹlik ssawaȓeɣ s yiȓesawen n iṯarrasen s lluɣa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:1">maƹlik ssawaȓeɣ s lluɣa n lmalaʼikaṯ <char style="it">iƹni ruḥiya</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:1">maca ȓemḥibbeṯ war ḏayi tiȓi ca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:1">iȓi tseddaƹeɣ am yij n darbuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:1">temqerqabeɣ am ȓeqraqeb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓeqraqeb niṯni ḏ qȓappaṯ.</char></note> waha.<verse eid="1CO 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Nec maƹlik ɣari lqudra aḏ ssiwȓeɣ am lʼanbiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:2">maƹlik fehmeɣ marra min inuffaren ḏ marra ṯusna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:2">maƹlik sxeddameɣ lʼiman aḏ smuttiɣ iḏurar-a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:2">iȓi ḏ walu iy ǧiɣ nec meȓa war tḥibbiɣ ca.<verse eid="1CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Nec maƹlik ṣeddqeɣ marra min ɣari ḏ agȓa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:3">maƹlik sellmeɣ ixef inu aḏ sḥerqen ddat-a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:3">iȓi nec war rebḥeɣ walu meȓa war tḥibbiɣ ca.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏayes ttisaƹ n ȓxaḍar, ḏayes ij n lḥanana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:4">Nettaṯ war teftaxar war ṯḥesseḏ ca.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 13:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:4">War ḏayes ttakebbur, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />aqa nettaṯ tseḏḥa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 13:5" />
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:5">War ṯrezzu ca x min ṯenwa nettaṯ waha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:5">War ishiȓ aḏ tƹeṣṣeb, meȓa ƹṣan-t tettu ḏeɣya.<verse eid="1CO 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />War ṯfarreḥ ca zi ccarr, ṯfarreḥ zi lḥaqiqa.<verse eid="1CO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />War ṯfeṭṭaḥ ƹemmarṣ. Tamen cḥaȓ ma ṯekka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:7">Ṯṣebbar x min ma iǧan. S lʼamal ȓebda tmenna.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Ȓemḥibbeṯ-a nettaṯ ƹemmarṣ aḏ teqḍa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:8">maca aḏ ntahan wawaȓen n lʼanbiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:8">iȓesawen n iṯarrasen war tɣimin ca ḏ lluɣa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:8">lmaƹrifa aḏ twakemmeȓ iƹni ṯusna.<verse eid="1CO 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Aqa min nessen maci ikmaȓ manaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:9">min nessawaȓ neccin lʼanbiya ḏ aneqṣi ig iǧa.<verse eid="1CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Min iǧan qaƹ ikmaȓ aḏ d iban ḏanita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:10">ssenni min iǧan ḏ aneqṣi aḏ iweddar netta.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Wami nec tuɣayi ḏ aseymi waha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:11">amecnaw aseymi ssiwȓeɣ am netta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:11">amecnaw aseymi tfekkareɣ am wanita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:11">amecnaw aseymi war tmeyyizeɣ s lfikra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:11">Nec wami ḏewȓeɣ ḏ aryaz baƹda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:11">semḥeɣ ḏeg ibriḏen n useymi-ya.<verse eid="1CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Aqa ȓexxu nxezzar ḏeg yijjen n ṯisiṯ war ṯeṣfi ca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:12">maca menbaƹd a nemẓer mliḥ qara ḏi qara.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 13:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:12">Ȓexxu min ssneɣ ḏ aneqṣi ig iǧa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:12">menbaƹd aḏ ssneɣ nec ṯimesȓayin marra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:12">kif-kif mammec twassneɣ nec ḏanita.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Aqaṯen ȓexxu qqimen ṯȓaṯa-ya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 13:13">lʼiman ḏ lʼamal ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ yina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 13:13">Maca zi yina ȓemḥibbeṯ ṯuƹȓa.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Ṯnayen lqudraṯ ruḥiyaṯ war twafhiment ca mliḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ḏfareṯ abriḏ n ȓemḥibbeṯ, rzuṯ mliḥ x lqudraṯ ruḥiyaṯ xaṣṣatan ṯenni n wawaȓ itwaƹeȓmen zi Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Cuf, wenni issawaȓen s lluɣa ruḥiya, ma issawaȓ ak yiwḏan? Lla, issawaȓ ak Arebbi. War ḏinni ḥadd iy ḏas ifehhmen, iqqar ṯimesȓayin s Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏaysent ȓmaƹnaṯ inuffaren. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Walakin wenni issawaȓen ak yiwḏan s min iƹȓem zi Arebbi ataf issawaḍ-asen ijjen n wawaȓ bac aḏ twajehhḏen aḏ twacejjƹen aḏ twaṣebbaren. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Wenni issawaȓen s lluɣa ruḥiya istenfaƹ ixef nnes. Wenni issawaȓen s min iƹȓem zi Arebbi istenfaƹ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Iwa xseɣ marra kenniw aḏ tessiwȓem s lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ, walakin mliḥ ƹaḏ aḏ tessiwȓem s wawaȓen iy ṯƹeȓmem zi Arebbi. Wenni issawaȓen s wawaȓ ig iƹȓem zi Arebbi netta imɣar x wenni issawaȓen s lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ, illa meȓa can yijjen aḏ istarjem ḥima aḏ istenfeƹ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Fa ȓexxu ay ayṯma, meȓa usiɣ-d ɣarwem ssawaȓeɣ nec s lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ, man nnfaƹ iy zi kenniw ɣa nefƹeɣ illa meȓa uwiɣ-awem-d can lwaḥi niɣ can ṯusna niɣ can wawaȓ iy ƹeȓmeɣ zi Arebbi niɣ can n ttaƹlim? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Amenni uȓa ḏ lʼalaṯ n lmusiqa war ḏaysent bu buḥbeȓ am ṯemja niɣ am ṯgambrit. Meȓa war ṯṣuḍeḏ nican war ṯneqṭeḏ war ḏac ticcen bu nneɣma, war ṯzemmareḏ aḏ tessneḏ lmusiqa nni min ṯeƹna. <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Ƹaweḏ amecnaw zzammar, meȓa war ḏayes ṯṣuḍeḏ ca s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯeṣfa, wi ɣa iswejḏen i ȓḥarb? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Ammu ƹaweḏ uȓa ḏ kenniw, meȓa twejwijem waha s wawaȓ nwem, wi ḏawem ɣa ifehmen min ṯeqqarem? Ataf awaȓ nwem kenniw am wenni issawaȓen ḏi ȓehwa! <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Bȓa ccekk ǧan aṭṭas n lʼanwaƹ n lluɣaṯ ḏi ddunect-a, walakin kur ict s ȓmaƹna nnes. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Iwa meȓa nec war ssineɣ ca ȓmaƹna n lluɣa nni, ataf nec aḏ iȓiɣ am yijjen ḏ abarrani ak wenni issawaȓen ataf netta ƹaweḏ akiḏi yiȓi am yij ubarrani. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Iwa kenniw, wami ṯrezzum aṭṭas x lqudraṯ ruḥiyaṯ, ggeṯ lmejhud nwem ḥima aḏ tarnum ḏi ṯinni iy zi istenfaƹen jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />S manayenni, wenni issawaȓen s lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ iẓẓaǧ ḥima aḏ istarjem min iqqar. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Liʼanna meȓa ẓẓuǧeɣ s lluɣa ruḥiya, arruḥ inu itẓaǧa walakin ȓaƹqeȓ inu war istenfiƹ ca. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Iwa min ɣa ggeɣ? Aḏ ẓẓaǧeɣ s arruḥ inu, aḏ ẓẓaǧeɣ ƹaweḏ s ȓaƹqeȓ inu. Aḏ ɣennjeɣ s arruḥ inu, aḏ ɣennjeɣ ƹaweḏ s ȓaƹqeȓ inu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Meȓa ṯcekkareḏ Arebbi s arruḥ waha, wenni iy ɣarwem d yusin s zziyara war izemmar aḏ yini amin x ccuker nnec liʼanna war issin ca min ṯeqqareḏ. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Wah, imken cek ṯcekkareḏ Arebbi walakin wenni nneɣni war ṯ ineffeƹ ca.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Tcekkareɣ Arebbi nec ssawaȓeɣ s lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ ktar zzaywem marra. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Innama, meȓa ssiwȓeɣ ak jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ɣir s xemsa n wawaȓen ataf aḏayi fehhmen ḥsen zi meȓa ssiwȓeɣ s ƹecraȓaf n wawaȓen s yijjen n lluɣa ruḥiya.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Lla ay ayṯma, war tfekkareṯ ca am iḥenjiren imezyanen. Iȓiṯ am iseyman ḏi ccarr; iȓiṯ am imeqqranen ƹlaḥsab ȓaƹqeȓ. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Iqqar ḏi Ccariƹa n Musa: "Nec aḏ ssiwȓeɣ aȓ yiwḏan-a s lluɣaṯ n iṯarrasen s iyencicen n ibarraniyen, waxxa amenni war ḏayi tṣenniṭen ca. Manaya iqqar-iṯ Siḏi Arebbi." <verse eid="1CO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />S wawaȓ-a, lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ niṯenti ḏ ijjen n lƹalama war ṯeǧi bu i yinni yumnen; Lla, aqat i yinni war yuminen ca. Walakin awaȓ nni itwaƹeȓmen zi Arebbi istenfaƹ yinni yumnen maci i yinni war yuminen ca.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Iḏen, meȓa ṯmunem jmaƹeṯ ṯekmaȓ n ȓmuminin ṯessawaȓem marra s lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ uḏfen-d jarawem yiwḏan n barra niɣ ḏ lkuffar, ataf qqaren xawem qa iwḏan-a ḏ ibuhaȓiyen. <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24-25" />Walakin, meȓa ṯessawaȓem marra kenniw s wawaȓen iy ṯƹeȓmem zi Arebbi yuḏef-d jarawem ḥadd zi barra niɣ ḏ ijjen n lkafir, ataf aḏ iḥess ḏeg yixef nnes qa aḏ itwaḥaseb aḏ iqneƹ zzaywem marra netta ḏ lƹaṣi, ataf azzayes twasufɣen marra lʼasrar n wuȓ nnes. Ṯumma aḏ isejjeḏ aḏ iƹbeḏ Arebbi aḏ yini qa Arebbi ḏ ṣṣaḥ aqaṯ jarawem!<verse eid="1CO 14:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nniḍam iy iǧan ḏi lƹibada ḏi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Iḏen fa ay ayṯma, xmi ɣa ṯmunem ijjen aɣares yiȓi ijjen n uɣennij, ijjen aɣares yiȓi ijjen n wawaȓ n useȓmeḏ, ijjen aɣares yiȓi lwaḥi, ijjen aɣares ṯiȓi lluɣa ruḥiya, ijjen aɣares ṯiȓi ttarjama. Marra ṯimesȓayin-a aḏ iȓint ḥima aḏ tjehḏem. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Meȓa ṯessiwȓem s yijjen n lluɣa ruḥiya, labud aḏ tessiwȓem ṯnayen niɣ ṯȓaṯa u ṣafi. Aḏ tessiwȓem ij-ij, u labud aḏ iqqim ijjen zzaywem aḏ istarjem. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Meȓa war ḏinni ḥadd aḏ istarjem, wenni issawaȓen aḏ istuk aḏ issiweȓ ḏeg wuȓ nnes ḏ Arebbi.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Fa lʼanbiya u labud aḏ ssiwȓen ṯnayen niɣ ṯȓaṯa. Inneɣni aḏ meyyzen awaȓen nni. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Meȓa ihwa-d ca n wawaȓ n lwaḥi x can yijjen jar n yinni iqqimen jarawem, ataf wenni issawaȓen ḏ amezwaru aḏ istuk. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Liʼanna ṯzemmarem marra aḏ tessiwȓem s min ṯƹeȓmem zi Arebbi ij-ij ḥima marra <char style="it">ȓmuminin</char> aḏ ȓemḏen aḏ twacejjƹen. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Wa lqudraṯ ruḥiyaṯ n lʼanbiya aqaṯent x yiri nsen s yixef nsen. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Liʼanna Arebbi war iǧi bu n ȓfawḍa walakin n ȓehna. Ḏ ṯanita ḏ lƹada iy ḏaysent ḏi marra ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="1CO 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />Ṯimɣarin ḏi ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin labud aḏ qqiment stukant. War ḏasent itwasmiḥ ca aḏ ssiwȓent. Labud aḏ tseḏḥant mammec ṯeqqar Ccariƹa n Musa. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Meȓa rezzunt aḏ ssnent can ṯmesȓayṯ, labud aḏ sseqsant iryazen nsent ḏi ṯeddarṯ. Liʼanna ṯamɣarṯ ḏ ȓƹib aḏ tessiweȓ ḏi ȓwesṭ n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Awaȓ n Arebbi, ma iffeɣ-d zzaywem kenniw? Ma yuweḍ-d ɣarwem kenniw waha? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Meȓa ijjen iḥesseb ixef nnes nican ḏ nnabi niɣ ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem ruḥiya ataf u labud aḏ iqbeȓ min ḏawem d tariɣ ḏi ṯebrat-a nettaṯ ḏ ȓuṣiyeṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Meȓa war iqbiȓ ca manaya, war itwaqebbiȓ ca netta. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />S manaya ay ayṯma, rzuṯ aṭṭas ḥima aḏ tessiwȓem s wawaȓ itwaƹeȓmen zi Arebbi, u ƹaweḏ war mennaƹṯ ca iwḏan aḏ ssiwȓen s lluɣaṯ ruḥiyaṯ. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Walakin itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏ teggem kuȓci maƹqul s yijjen n nniḍam nican.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Lqiyama n Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Fa ay ayṯma akenniw sfekkareɣ x Lʼinjil iy zi kenniw beccareɣ, iƹni netta ṯqebȓem-ṯ u mtebṯin xas. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Aqa ṯnejjmem zzayes wami ḏayes teṭṭfem mliḥ ḏeg wawaȓ n ttebcir nni wenni iy zi kenniw beccareɣ. Meȓa lla, zaƹma lʼiman nwem ṯesbeṭṭȓem-ṯ.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />
    <char style="bd">Cuf, ssiwḍeɣ-awem-d manayenni iǧan muhim tuɣa qebȓeɣ-ṯ nec s yixef inu, iƹni Lmasiḥ immuṯ ƹlaḥsab ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ mammec iqqar Lkitab.</char> <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" /><char style="bd">Ṯumma itwanḍeȓ, ṯumma itwasnekkar-d ḏeg wass wis ṯeȓtiyyam mammec iqqar Lkitab.</char> <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Ṯumma imeḍhar-as-d i Buṭrus,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buṭrus isem nnes ḏi Lkitab n lʼaṣel qqaren-as Keyfaṣ.</char></note> ssenni imeḍhar-asen-d i ṯenƹac nni n arrusul. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Menbaƹd imeḍhar-asen-d i ktar zi xemsmiyya n wawmaṯen ḏi twaȓa ḏ icten. Niṯni ƹaḏ ddaren ƹaȓayen marra iḏsen, ȓebƹaḍ zzaysen aqa ṭṭṣen <char style="it">iƹni mmuṯen</char>. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Ṯumma imeḍhar-as-d i Yaƹqub, menbaƹd i marra arrusul. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Ɣar uneggaru qaƹ imeḍhar-ayi-d i nec, axmi nec ƹeḍȓeɣ war d xȓiqeɣ ca ḏi zman inu nican. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Aqa nec ḏ amezyan qaƹ ḏi arrusul. War sḏihiǧeɣ ca aḏayi ȓaɣan arrasul ȓaḥeqqac tuɣa nec tƹeddabeɣ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Walakin nec s arḍa n Arebbi ḏewȓeɣ mammec ǧiɣ ȓexxu. Ṯumma arḍa nnes war iǧi bu xafi s bȓa nnfaƹ; Lla, nec ccaṯeɣ tamara ktar zzaysen marra. Maci ḏ nec zaƹma; Lla, ḏ arḍa n Arebbi iy kiḏi. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Falihaḏa waxxa ḏ nec niɣ ḏ niṯni, ḏ wanita ḏ ttebcir iy zi netbeccar ssenni kenniw ṯumnem zzayes.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lqiyama n imettinen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Fa Lmasiḥ netbeccar xas itwasekkar-d zi ȓmewṯ. Mammec qqaren ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem war ṯeǧi bu lqiyama n imettinen? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Meȓa walu lqiyama n imettinen, uȓa ḏ Lmasiḥ war d itwasekkar ca. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Maƹlik war d itwasekkar ca Lmasiḥ, iȓi ttebcir nneɣ ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ waha, iȓi kenniw lʼiman nwem uȓa ḏ netta ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Maƹlik amenni, iȓi nufa ixef nneɣ ncehheḏ ẓẓur x Arebbi. Mayemmi? Ȓaḥeqqac necheḏ x Arebbi belli isekkar-d Lmasiḥ zi ȓmewṯ. Walakin maƹlik war tiȓi bu lqiyama n imettinen, iȓi Arebbi zaƹma war d isekkar ca Lmasiḥ zi ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Cuf, maƹlik imettinen war d twasnekkaren ca, iȓi Lmasiḥ zaƹma war d itwasekkar ca uȓa ḏ netta. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Maƹlik war d itwasekkar ca Lmasiḥ, iȓi kenniw zaƹma lʼiman nwem ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ waha, iȓi ƹaḏ aqa kenniw ḏi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nwem. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Maƹlik amenni, iȓi yinni iṭṭṣen <char style="it">iƹni yinni immuṯen</char> ḏi Lmasiḥ zaƹma ṣafi qa fnan. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Maƹlik negga lʼamal nneɣ ḏi Lmasiḥ ƹlaḥsab ṯuḏarṯ-a ṯanita waha, iȓi s manaya netziǧiz i yiwḏan zaƹma ktar zeg yiwḏan marra.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Fa aqa ȓexxu Lmasiḥ itwasekkar-d zi ȓmewṯ, iƹni netta ḏ ṯafeǧaḥṯ ṯamezwarut iy d ikkaren zeg yinni immuṯen. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Cuf, s yijjen n bnaḏem <char style="it">Adam</char> ṯusa-d zzayes ȓmewṯ. S yijjen n bnaḏem ƹaweḏ ṯusa-d zzayes lqiyama n imettinen. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ȓaḥeqqac am mammec iy ɣa nemmeṯ marra s bnaḏem nni Adam, ammu ƹaweḏ aɣarneɣ ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ i marra neccin s Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Walakin kuȓ ijjen nnubeṯ nnes: Lmasiḥ netta ḏ ṯafeǧaḥṯ ṯamezwarut. Xmi d ɣa iƹqeb netta, aḏ d tas nnubeṯ n yinni iǧan zzayes netta.<verse eid="1CO 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Ṯumma aḏ yiȓi ȓefna n ddunect-a. Lmasiḥ aḏ iqḍa x marra ȓeḥkam ḏ ȓmexzen ḏ jjheḏ ig iǧan, ṯumma aḏ ijj ȓeḥkam nni nnes i Arebbi Babas. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Aqa itxeṣṣa aḏ iḥkem Lmasiḥ aȓ ɣa igg Arebbi marra ȓƹaḏyan nnes swadday n ssulṭa n iḍaren nnes. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Ȓaƹḏu aneggaru iy ɣa ibeṭṭeȓ nettaṯ ḏ ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Aqa Arebbi igga marra ṯimesȓayin swadday i ssulṭa n iḍaren n Lmasiḥ. Walakin xmi iqqar qa marra ṯimesȓayin twaggent swadday nnes, nessen belli Arebbi war iǧi bu jar n ṯmesȓayin nni ȓaḥeqqac Arebbi s yixef nnes netta ig iggin marra ṯimesȓayin nni swadday n ssulṭa n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Xmi ɣa iȓint marra ṯimesȓayin-a swadday n ssulṭa n Lmasiḥ, ṯumma Mmis <char style="it">iƹni Lmasiḥ</char> s yixef nnes aḏ iḏweȓ uȓa ḏ netta swadday n ssulṭa n Arebbi ig iggin marra ṯimesȓayin-a swadday n ssulṭa n Lmasiḥ. Ammu aḏ yiȓi Arebbi ḏ marra ḏi min ḏi ma.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Cuf, yinni itwaṭehharen s waman ƹlaḥsab i yinni immuṯen, man nnfaƹ iy rezzun niṯni? Meȓa ḏ ṣṣaḥ zaƹma belli yinni immuṯen war d twasnekkaren ca, mayemmi iwḏan-a tetwaṭehharen s waman ƹlaḥsab i yinni immuṯen? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Y nec, mayemmi ǧiɣ ḏi lxaṭar kuȓ ṯsaƹƹat? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Ay ayṯma, twajaheɣ ȓmewṯ kuȓ nhar! Qqareɣ-awem manaya s lʼiftixar-a iy ɣari ḏaywem ƹlaḥsab ṯuḏarṯ-a nneɣ iy ɣarneɣ ḏ icten ak Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Nec meȓa ƹlaḥsab ṯimesȓayin n ddunect-a waha, mayemmi menɣeɣ ak ȓuḥuc ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus? Min ɣa rebḥeɣ? Imettinen, meȓa war d tnekkaren ca zi ȓmewṯ, <char style="it">i mayemmi</char>?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">"Yallah a necceṯ a nesweṯ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">qa ṯiwecca a nemmeṯ."<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />War xeddƹeṯ ca ixef nwem:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:33">"Ṯamƹacareṯ ṯaƹeffant,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:33">tḍeyyaƹ ttarbiya ṯaṣebḥant."<verse eid="1CO 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem, war ƹeṣṣaṯ ca. Qqareɣ-awem manaya bac aḏ tseḏḥam minzi ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem ḏaysen ȓeqfareṯ x Arebbi.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ddat nni iy ɣarneɣ ɣa yiȓin ḏi lqiyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Walakin ijjen aḏ yini: Imettinen, mammec ɣa ggen aḏ d kkaren? Man ṣṣifeṯ iy zi d ɣa ḏewȓen? <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />A wenni war ifhimen, ṯaḥebbuyṯ nni iy ṯzerrƹeḏ aḏ temmeṯ zaƹma <char style="it">swadday n ucaȓ,</char> menbaƹd aḏ teɣmi. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />U ṯenni ṯzerrƹeḏ cek nettaṯ war ṯeǧi bu ḏ ṣṣifeṯ nni iy d ɣa iɣmin. Lla, ṯzerrƹeḏ ɣiȓ ijjen n ṯḥebbuyṯ waha n zzarriƹeṯ n yirḏan niɣ ḏ ca n zzarriƹeṯ nneɣni. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ṯumma iticc-as Arebbi ijjen n ṣṣifeṯ iy ɣa ixḍar netta. Kuȓ nnuƹ n zzarriƹeṯ iticc-as ṣṣifeṯ nnes waḥḏes.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Aysum ƹaweḏ war iǧi bu marra kif-kif. Iryazen ɣarsen ijjen n nnuƹ n uysum waḥeḏsen, lḥayawanaṯ waḥeḏsen, ijḍaḍ ijjen n nnuƹ waḥeḏsen, iseȓman ƹaweḏ waḥeḏsen.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Ƹaweḏ ḏinni ṣṣifaṯ n ṯmesȓayin iy iǧan ḏeg ujenna. Ƹaweḏ ḏinni ṣṣifaṯ n ṯmesȓayin iy iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ. Aceƹceƹ n min iǧan ḏeg ujenna netta ḏ ijjen n nnuƹ. Aceƹceƹ n min iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ netta ḏ ijjen n nnuƹ. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Ṯfuct ɣares nnuƹ n uceƹceƹ nnes waḥḏes. Ṯaziri ɣares nnuƹ n uceƹceƹ nnes waḥḏes. Iṯran nnuƹ n uceƹceƹ nsen waḥeḏsen. Kuȓ iṯri ƹaweḏ ḏ aceƹceƹ nnes waḥḏes.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ammu iy ṯiȓi lqiyama n imettinen. Min itwazerrƹen aḏ ifna, min d itwasnekkaren aḏ iḏum. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Ddat twazerreƹ ḏi ȓefḍiḥeṯ, twasnekkar-d ḏi ccenƹeṯ. Twazerreƹ ḏi ḍḍuƹef, twasnekkar-d ḏi jjheḏ. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Twazerreƹ ḏ ijjen n ddat n bnaḏem, twasnekkar-d ḏ ijjen n ddat ruḥiya. Meȓa ṯeǧa ddat n bnaḏem, ṯeǧa ƹaweḏ ddat ruḥiya. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ammu iqqar Lkitab: "Bnaḏem amezwaru iƹni Adam iḏweȓ ḏ buḥbeȓ iddaren." Adam aneggaru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adam aneggaru iƹni netta ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.</char></note> netta ḏ buḥbeȓ ig iseddaren. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Min iǧan ruḥiya war d itis ca ḏ amezwaru; Lla, itas-d min iǧan n bnaḏem. Min iǧan ruḥiya itas-d menbaƹd. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Bnaḏem amezwaru itwaṣenneƹ zeg ucaȓ n ṯmurṯ, bnaḏem wis ṯnayen yusa-d zeg ujenna. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Mammec iy iǧa bnaḏem nni itwaṣennƹen zeg ucaȓ, amenni ƹaweḏ iy ǧan yiwḏan itwaṣennaƹen zeg ucaȓ. Wa mammec iy iǧa bnaḏem nni n ujenna, amenni ƹaweḏ iy ǧan yiwḏan n ujenna. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Mammec netcabbah ḏi ṣṣifeṯ n wenni itwaṣennƹen zeg ucaȓ, amenni ƹaweḏ iy ɣa ncabbah ḏi ṣṣifeṯ n wenni zeg ujenna.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Fa qqareɣ-awem ay ayṯma, qa aysum ḏ iḏammen war zemmaren aḏ warṯen ḏi ȓmulk ujenna. Min ifennan war iwarreṯ ca min war ifennin. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51-52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51-52" />Aqa qqareɣ-awem ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ ȓmaƹna nnes inuffaren: Qa war netmetti ca s marra iḏneɣ. Xmi ɣa iṣuḍ zzammar aneggaru ataf a nbeddeȓ marra iḏneɣ <char style="it">ḏi ṣṣifeṯ nneɣni</char>. Manaya aḏ yiȓi ḏeɣya ḏeg yijjen n warmac n ṯiṭṭ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.51-52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Armac qqaren-t i uɣemmez.</char></note> Aḏ iṣuḍ zzammar nni ṯumma aḏ d twasnekkaren imettinen iƹni aḏ duman i ȓebda a niȓi nbeddeȓ <char style="it">ḏi ṣṣifeṯ nneɣni</char>.<verse eid="1CO 15:51-52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Cuf, min ifennan itxeṣṣa aḏ iɣmes s min war ifennin, ḏ min itmettan itxeṣṣa aḏ iɣmes s min war itmettin. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Min ifennan xmi ɣa iɣmes s min war ifennin, ḏ min itmettan xmi ɣa iɣmes s min war itmettin, ȓexddenni aḏ d iffeɣ min yurin ḏi Lkitab: &lt;Ȓmewṯ iseɣȓey-t arbaḥ.&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />&lt;Hiwa cem a Ȓmewṯ, arbaḥ nnem mani iǧa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Hiwa cem a Ȓmewṯ, ṯiqqest nnem mani ṯeǧa?&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Aqa ȓmewṯ ṯiqqest nnes tas-d zi ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. Qa ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ṯizemmar nnes tas-d zi ccariƹa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Neccin a neḥmeḏ Arebbi! Netta iticc-aneɣ-d bac a nerbeḥ s Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />S manaya ay ayṯma imƹizzen inu, beddeṯ nican maci akenniw senhezzen. Ggeṯ lmejhud nwem ȓebda ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ, qa ṯessnem belli ȓxeḏmeṯ nwem ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ maci ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Ṣṣaḏaqa i ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin ḏi ṯendint n Lquds</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Ƹlaḥsab ṣṣaḏaqa i ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin, swejḏeṯ kenniw mammec ṯent weṣṣiɣ i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin ḏi lʼiqlim n Galaṭya. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Ḏi nhar amezwaru n kuȓ simana, kur ijjen zzaywem itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ ikkes ca n tmenyaṯ ƹlaḥsab lmanḍa nnes aṯent ixemmeȓ. Maci aȓ d ɣa aseɣ nec ƹaḏ aḏ tebḏam aḏ tesmunem tmenyaṯ-a. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Menbaƹd, iƹni xmi iy d ɣa awḍeɣ nec, ataf aḏ d ssekkeɣ yinni iy ɣa ṯsejjlem ḏi ṯebraṯin belli ḏaysen ttiqeṯ aḏ raḥen aḏ awin ṣṣaḏaqa-ya iy ṯesmunem ɣar ṯendint n Lquds. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Meȓa u labud aḏ raḥeɣ uȓa ḏ nec, akiḏi raḥen.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ḏ yinni iy kiḏes ixeddmen i Siḏiṯneɣ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Fa xmi ɣa ƹḏuɣ Masidunya aɣarwem d aseɣ, qa nec ƹaḏ aḏ d kkeɣ ssenni x Masidunya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Imken akiḏwem qqimeɣ ijjen n ȓweqṯ niɣ akiḏwem seƹḏuɣ ȓmecta bac aḏayi ṯƹawnem ḏeg usafar inu mani ma ruḥeɣ. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Ȓexxu war xseɣ ca akenniw ẓreɣ minzi axawem d kkeɣ waha; Lla, tmenniɣ ƹaḏ akiḏwem qqimeɣ ijjen n lmudda iƹni meȓa ixes Arebbi. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Nec aḏ qqimeɣ ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus aȓ ɣa d yaweḍ Ȓƹiḏ n nhar wis xemsin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ȓƹiḏ n nhar wis xemsin ḏ ijjen n ȓƹiḏ n Ayṯ-Israʼil itas-d xemsin yum menbaƹd i Ȓƹiḏ ameqqran nsen.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Aqa ṯnurzem-ayi-d ijjen n ṯewwarṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant i ȓxeḏmeṯ walakin yinni ig itƹarraḍen aqaṯen mujudin.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Meȓa yusa-d Timutawus thellam ḏayes mliḥ bac war ḏayes itiȓi ca umnus ȓaḥeqqac netta itegg ȓxeḏmeṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ amecnaw nec. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Itxeṣṣa uȓa ḏ ijjen war aṯ iseḥqar ca. Ƹawnem-ṯ ḏeg usafar nnes bac aɣari d iƹqeb ḏi ȓehna ȓaḥeqqac nec trajiɣ-ṯ ak ayṯmaṯneɣ.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />U ƹlaḥsab umaṯneɣ Apullus, ttareɣ zzayes aṭṭas ḥima aɣarwem d yas ak ayṯmaṯneɣ nneɣni walakin netta yugi aɣarwem d yas ȓexxu. Aɣarwem d yas axmi aɣares ṯiȓi ijjen n lfurṣa. <verse eid="1CO 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Iȓiṯ ƹlalbal, beddeṯ nican ḏi lʼiman, iȓiṯ ḏ iryazen, iȓiṯ ṯjehḏem. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Marra min ɣa ṯeggem kenniw teggem-ṯ s ȓemḥibbeṯ.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15-16" />Aqa ṯessnem Stifanus ḏ ȓeḥbab nnes ḏ niṯni iy yumnen zi Lmasiḥ ḏ imezwura ḏi lʼiqlim n Uxaya, ṭewwƹen ixef nsen aḏ sexxaren i ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin. Ay ayṯma, tettareɣ zzaywem aḏ tṭaƹem i yiwḏan-a am yina u ḏ yinni marra icarrcen ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a tamaran ḏayes aṭṭas. <verse eid="1CO 16:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Nec farḥeɣ wami d usin Stifanus ḏ Furtunaws ḏ Axeykus ȓaḥeqqac ƹemmaren imucan nwem. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Niṯni sreyyaḥen uȓ inu ḏ wuȓ nwem. Iwa weqqareṯ iwḏan am yina.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin ḏi lʼiqlim n Asya tseǧament-id xawem. Akilas ḏ Priskila ḏ yinni iǧan ḏi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯeddarṯ nsen tseǧamen-d xawem aṭṭas ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Tseǧamen-d xawem marra aymaṯneɣ. Seǧamem x wayawya s yijjen n sȓam iṣfa.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Sȓam-a uriɣ-ṯ nec Bulus s ufus inu. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Wenni war ixsen ca Siḏiṯneɣ aḏ itwaḥarrem. Araḥ-d a Mawlana! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa akiḏwem yiȓi. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Ȓemḥibbeṯ inu akiḏwem ṯiȓi kenniw marra ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Amin.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>